<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- ZARAMO Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">YOHANA</para>
  <para style="toc1">USENGA UNOGILE WA YESU KILISTO KAMBA VIWANDIKIGWE NA YOHANA</para>
  <para style="toc2">YOHANA</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoh.</para>
  <para style="mt2">USENGA UNOGILE WA YESU KILISTO KAMBA VIWANDIKIGWE NA</para>
  <para style="mt1">YOHANA</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOZI</para>
  <para style="ip">Usenga Unogile wa Yesu Kilisto Kamba Viwandikigwe na Yohana uwo usenga umwe kulawa m'vitabu vine va Lagano da Isambi visimulila ugima wa Yesu Kilisto. Vitabu vose vino vine vokemigwa, “Injili,” nhegulo yake “Usenga Unogile,” vandikigwa na Matayo, Maluko, Luka, na Yohana kipigiti Yesu viyeshile kudanganhika. Usenga Unogile wa Yesu Kilisto Kamba Viwandikigwe na Yohana siku wandikigwa na mtumigwa wa Kilisto Yohana mmilao ya 90 songela kuvumbuka kwa Yesu Kilisto. Hata kamba kitabu chenyego hakilonga kamba Yohana iyo yandike, ila vija vichandikwe kilumba ng'hani na mhwilili za Yohana wa ichanduso, Yohana wa ikabili, na Yohana wa ikadatu. Wandishi wayagwe wa umwaka wamulonga.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohana kakala yokala mdiwambo da Efeso kipigiti kino. Avo ilinga na kulonga kamba kitabu kino chandikigwa mdiwambo da Efeso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohana kosimulila kinaganaga kamba kilamso cha kwandika kitabu kino kikala kuwataza wanhu watogole kamba Yesu iyo Kilisto, Mwana wa Mulungu yali na ugima (Yoh. 20:31). Mkutogola gano tuwe na ugima mditwaga jake. Kitabu kino chandikigwa sama ya wasomaji wa namna zose mbili, Wayahudi na waja hawali Wayahudi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Usenga Unogile wa Yohana haulingile kabisa na Senga zija ndatu ziyagwe. Heyo kakala yalolile ng'hani mizonza iyatendile Yesu, ila handike ng'hani mahala ga Yesu. Mbuli ziyagwe za mwanduso kamba vija kubatizwigwa kwa Yesu na kugezigwa muluwala vivija hazandikigwe Muusenga uno Unogile.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali Mgati ya Ikitabu</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Yohana kosonga Usenga Unogile (<char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 1:1-18">1:1-18</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Abaho Yohana kokwandika mizonza bwando iyatendile Yesu (<char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 1:19-12:50">1:19—12:50</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Abaho Yohana kosimulila mbuli bwando ziyatendile Yesu kipigiti viyakalile muulumwengu zimulongoze kuna iifa yake na kuzuka (<char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 13:1-20:31">13:1—20:31</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Abaho Yohana komambukizila Usenga wake yolonga kipigiti kimwe Yesu viyoneke mwa wanhu kipigiti viyazukile kulawa mkudanganhika, abaho, kasonga nia yake ya kwandika ikitabu (<char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 21">21</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Mbuli Ilava Ugima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1"/>Haichanduso kukala na Mbuli, Mbuli ija kakala na Mulungu, na Mbuli ija kakala Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2"/>Songela haichanduso Mbuli kakala na Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3"/>Mulungu kavilumba vinhu vose kubitila heyo, haduhu kinhu chochose kilumbigwe na Mulungu bila heyo. <verse eid="JHN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4"/>Mbuli ija kakala iyo ichanduso cha ugima, na ugima uno uwo ugala mulangaza mwa wanhu wose. <verse eid="JHN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5"/>Mulangaza uno womulika mdiziza, na ziza hadidaha kuuhuma.<verse eid="JHN 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6"/>Mulungu kamtuma munhu imwe yokemigwa Yohana, <verse eid="JHN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7"/>keza kamba msindila, giladi yalave usindila wa mulangaza uja, avo wanhu wose watogole kubitila heyo. <verse eid="JHN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8"/>Heyo mwenyego hakalile mulangaza, ila keza kamba msindila wa mulangaza. <verse eid="JHN 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9"/>Uno uwo mulangaza wa kweli, uwamwemwesa wanhu wose, ukalile ukwiza muulumwengu.<verse eid="JHN 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10"/>Heyo iyo mulangaza ukalile muulumwengu, avo Mulungu kaulumba ulumwengu mkubitila heyo, ila ulumwengu haumtangile. <verse eid="JHN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11"/>Keza mwa wanhu zake mwenyego, ila wanhu zake mwenyego hawam'bokele. <verse eid="JHN 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12"/>Ila wanhu wose wam'bokele na kumtogola, kawagwelela udaho wa kuwa wana wa Mulungu, <verse eid="JHN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13"/>awo watendigwe wawe wana wa Mulungu si sama ya mulopa ama sama ya manogelwa ga lukuli ama sama ya manogelwa ga munhu, ila sama ya manogelwa ga Mulungu.<verse eid="JHN 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14"/>Mbuli kagaluka munhu, kakala hamoja na tweye. Tuyona yenzi yake, yenzi ya kamba mwana imwe yeiyeka wa Tata, yamemile ngekewa na kweli.<verse eid="JHN 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15"/>Yohana kazipeta mbuli zake Yesu. Kenula dizwi yolonga, “Ino iyo munhu inikalile nimulonga, avija vinilongile, ‘Kokwiza hachugu changu, ila heyo iyo mkulu kubanza nie, kwavija kipigiti nie sinavumbuka heyo kakala baho.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16"/>Avija viyamemile ngekewa tweye tose tubokela motelo zose. <verse eid="JHN 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17"/>Mulungu katugwelela Malagizo kubitila Musa, ila ngekewa na kweli viza kubitila Yesu Kilisto. <verse eid="JHN 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18"/>Haduhu munhu yoyose yamonile Mulungu, ila Mwana yeiyeka, ayo yali hamgwazo wa Tata, iyo yamtendile Tata yatangigwe.<verse eid="JHN 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yohana Kogong'ondeza Kamba Heyo Sio Kilisto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat. 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mlk. 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk. 3:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19"/>Uno uwo usindila uyalavile Yohana kipigiti wakulu wa Wayahudi viwawatumile wakulu wa nhambiko na Walawi kulawa Yelusalemu wakamuuze, “Gweye iyo yalihi?”<verse eid="JHN 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20"/>Yohana kawedika kawalongela kinaganaga, “Nie sili Kilisto.”<verse eid="JHN 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21"/>Wamuuza, “Kumbe gweye iyo yalihi? Gweye kwa Eliya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Yohana kawalongela, “Nie sili Eliya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Wamuuza, “Gweye kwa Muhokozi ija?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Kawalongela, “Nie sili Muhokozi ija.”<verse eid="JHN 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22"/>Wamulongela, “Basi tulongele gweye iyo yalihi? Giladi tukawalongele waja watutumile. Mzingelegeza zako gweye mwenyego koilongaze?”<verse eid="JHN 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23"/>Yohana kalonga, kuno yokwiga mbuli za Muhokozi Isaya, yolonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">“Nie dijo ‘Dizwi da munhu yoguta muluwala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 1:23">Igoloseni nzila yondayabite Mndewa.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24"/>Waja iwasenga, watumigwe na Mafalisayo, <verse eid="JHN 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25"/>wamuuza Yohana, “Kamba gweye huli Kilisto ama Eliya ama Muhokozi ija, habali ubatiza?”<verse eid="JHN 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26"/>Yohana kawalongela, “Nie nobatiza na mazi, ila mmwanza wenu mweye mwimile aho kema munhu hamumtangile. <verse eid="JHN 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27"/>Ayo yondayeze hachugu changu, nie silumba hata kudohola nzabi za ng'hwabasa zake.”<figure style="fig" alt="sandals" file="NT-05 Sandals.jpg" size="col" loc="John 1:27" copy="Jonathan McDaniel" ref="Yoh. 1:27"/><verse eid="JHN 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28"/>Mbuli zino zose zilawilila mkiwambo cha Betania ng'ambu ya ulawilo wa zua ya Lwanda lwa Yolodani, aho Yohana hayakalile yobatiza.<verse eid="JHN 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwana Ng'hondolo wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29"/>Zua da ikabili Yohana kamona Yesu yokwiza, kalonga, “Lola! Mwana Ng'hondolo wa Mulungu yosola vilozo va ulumwengu! <verse eid="JHN 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30"/>Ino iyo munhu inikalile nimulonga, ‘Kokwiza munhu hachugu changu, yali mkulu kubanza nie, kwavija kakala baho kipigiti nie sinavumbuka.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31"/>Nie mwenyego simtangile kamba heyo iyo Kilisto, ila nie niza kubatiza na mazi sama ya kilamso kino, siku kogubuligwa mwa wanhu wa Islaeli.”<verse eid="JHN 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32"/>Na Yohana kalava usindila uno, yolonga, “Nimona Loho wa Mulungu yohumuluka kulawa kuulanga kamba hua na kukala uchana yake. <verse eid="JHN 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33"/>Nie sambinimtange, ila ayo yandagize nie kubatiza na mazi, kanongela, ‘Uhamona Loho wa Mulungu yohumuluka na kukala uchana ya munhu, iyo, iyo munhu yondayabatize na Loho wa Mulungu.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34"/>Na nie nigona gano, na nilava usindila kamba, ino iyo Mwana wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wanahina wa Yesu wa Ichanduso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35"/>Zua da ikabili Yohana kakala yemile kabili bahaja na wanahina zake wabili, <verse eid="JHN 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36"/>viyamuwene Yesu yobita behi na hewo, kalonga, “Loleni! Mwana Ng'hondolo wa Mulungu.” <verse eid="JHN 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37"/>Waja iwanahina wabili viwamuhulike yolonga gano, wamkweleleza Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38"/>Yesu viyahinduke kawona womkweleleza, kawauza, “Mozahila choni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Wamuuza, “Labi, kwahi kuukala?” “Labi,” nhegulo yake “Mkulufunzi.”<verse eid="JHN 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Izoni mulole.” Avo wachola wahone haja hayakalile yokala, na wakala na heyo zua dija jose. Ikala kamba saa longo dimwe ichungulo. <verse eid="JHN 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40"/>Imwe wa wanahina waja wabili yamuhulike Yohana yolonga na kumkweleleza Yesu kakala Endelea mkulu wake Simoni Petulo. <verse eid="JHN 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41"/>Kinhu cha ichanduso kiyatendile Endelea kikala kumzahila ndugu yake Simoni na kumulongela, “Tumona Masihi.” Mbuli ino nhegulo yake iyo, “Kilisto.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:41 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Kilisto </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ayo yasaguligwe na Mulungu.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42"/>Abaho, kamsola kamgala ha Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Yesu kamulola kalonga, “Twaga jako kokemigwa Simoni, mwana wa Yohana, ila songela lelo kokemigwa Kefa.” Twaga dino nhegulo yake iyo “Dibwe.”<verse eid="JHN 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kowakema Filipo na Natanieli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43"/>Zua da ikabili Yesu kalonda kuchola Galilaya, kam'vika Filipo kamulongela, “Nikoleleze.” <verse eid="JHN 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44"/>Filipo kakala yolawa Betisaida, kiwambo chawakalile wokala Endelea na Petulo. <verse eid="JHN 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45"/>Filipo kamzahila Natanieli kamulongela, “Tumona munhu ayo Musa yandike mbuli zake mkitabu cha Malagizo na ayo vivija wahokozi wandike mbuli zake, Yesu, mwana wa Usufu, kulawa Nazaleti.”<verse eid="JHN 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46"/>Natanieli kauza, “Vodahika kinhu kinogile kilawe Nazaleti?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Filipo kalonga, “Izo ulole.”<verse eid="JHN 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47"/>Yesu viyamuwene Natanieli yokwiza, kalonga, “Lola! Ino iyo Muislaeli mwenyego kabisa, mduhu uzenzeleganye mmoyo wake!”<verse eid="JHN 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48"/>Natanieli kamuuza, “Kunitangaze?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">Yesu kalonga, “Nikona vuukalile hasi ya umtini kipigiti Filipo hanakukema.”<verse eid="JHN 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49"/>Natanieli kalonga, “Mkulufunzi, gweye kwa Mwana wa Mulungu! Gweye kwa Mndewa wa Islaeli!”<verse eid="JHN 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Kutogola kwavija nikulongela nikona vuukalile hasi ya umtini? Avo kovona vinhu vikulu kubanza vino!” <verse eid="JHN 1:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51"/>Abaho, kawalongela, “Nowalongela ikweli, mowona ulanga uvuguka na wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga wokwela na kunihumulukila nie Mwana wa Munhu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Lusona lwa Zengele Mkiwambo cha Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1"/>Zua da ikadatu kukala na lusona lwa zengele mkiwambo kikemigwa Kana muisi ya Galilaya. Mamaake Yesu kakala bahaja. <verse eid="JHN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2"/>Yesu na wanahina zake vivija wagonekigwa hana ulusona luja lwa zengele. <verse eid="JHN 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3"/>Divai viimalile, mamaake Yesu kamulongela, “Wabule divai.”<verse eid="JHN 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Mama, gano gavikaze kumwetu? Kipigiti changu hakinavika.”<verse eid="JHN 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5"/>Abaho, mamaake Yesu kawalongela waja wakalile wosang'hanika na vakuja, “Tendeni chochose chondayawalongele.”<verse eid="JHN 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6"/>Haja kukala na minongo sita ya mazi itendigwe na mabwe, na kila nongo dimwe dikala na ukulu wa nongo mbili ama ndatu kwavija Wayahudi wakala na nzoela ya kuinava makono na magulu. <verse eid="JHN 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7"/>Yesu kawalongela waja wakalile wosang'hanika, “Memezeni mazi minongo ino.” Avo wamemeza minongo yose mbaka hamulomo. <verse eid="JHN 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8"/>Abaho, kawalongela, “Haya, deheni vimazi vidodo mkamgwelele mkulu wa ulusona.” Wasola gamazi wamgalila mkulu wa ulusona. <verse eid="JHN 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9"/>Mkulu wa ulusona viyagalanzile gamazi gakalile gagaluke divai, kakanganya kwahi kuilawile divai ija. Ila waja wakalile wosang'hanika na ulusona wadehile gamazi wavitanga, avo kamkema imulawilamhambe, <verse eid="JHN 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10"/>kamulongela, “Wanhu wose wagomelaga divai inogile haichanduso, na iwahenza wehesha kung'wa ng'hani kowagomela divai igwaduke, ila gweye kwika divai inogile mbaka vino!”<verse eid="JHN 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11"/>Yesu katenda mzonza uno wa mwanduso mkiwambo cha Kana muisi ya Galilaya, aho hayailaguse yenzi yake, na wanahina zake wamtogola.<verse eid="JHN 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12"/>Abaho Yesu na mamaake, wandugu zake, na wanahina zake wachola Kapenaumu, wakala haja mazua madodo.<verse eid="JHN 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kochola Kung'anda ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Mat. 21:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mlk. 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luk. 19:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13"/>Lusona lwa Pasaka lwa Wayahudi lukala lukwenhuke, avo Yesu kachola Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14"/>Akuja kung'anda ya Mulungu kawavika wanhu woguza ng'ombe, ng'hondolo, na nziwa, na wavunja hela wakala wakalile mzimeza zao. <verse eid="JHN 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15"/>Avo kasola nzabi kogosa lukumbulu, kasonga kuwawinga waja iwang'onyo wose yowalava hanze ya Ing'anda ya Mulungu, ng'hondolo hamoja na ng'ombe. Kazihindula zimeza za wavunja hela na kuzipwililisa zihela zao, <verse eid="JHN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16"/>na kawalongela awo wakalile woguza nziwa, yolonga, “Wasegezeni nziwa zenu hano! Lekeni kutenda Ng'anda ya Tataangu kuwa gulilo!” <verse eid="JHN 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17"/>Wanahina zake wakumbukila avija Zinyandiko Zing'alile vuzilonga, “Nogelwa iniinogele ng'anda yako, Mulungu, yondukuza kamba moto.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Yondukuza kamba moto </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">wonikoma.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18"/>Wakulu wa Wayahudi wamwidika mkumuuza, “Mzonza ulihi wondautulagusile tuvitange kamba kuna udaho wa kutenda mbuli zino?”<verse eid="JHN 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Bomoleni Ng'anda ino ya Mulungu, na nie noizenga kabili mmazua madatu.”<verse eid="JHN 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20"/>Wamuuza, “Kodahaze gweye kuizenga kabili mmazua madatu? Ng'anda ino ya Mulungu isola milao malongo mane na sita kumambukiza kuizenga!”<verse eid="JHN 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21"/>Ila ng'anda ya Mulungu iyailongile Yesu ikala lukuli lwake. <verse eid="JHN 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22"/>Viyazukile kulawa mkudanganhika, wanahina zake wakumbukila kamba kakala yalongile gano, na wazitogola Zinyandiko Zing'alile na gaja Yesu gayalongile.<verse eid="JHN 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Viyawatangile Wanhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23"/>Kipigiti cha Lusona lwa Pasaka Yesu kakala Yelusalemu, wanhu bwando viwonile mizonza iyaitendile wamtogola. <verse eid="JHN 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24"/>Ila Yesu haitogole nhogola yao, kwavija kautanga uzenzeleganye wa wanhu. <verse eid="JHN 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25"/>Halondile munhu yoyose yamulongele mbuli za wanhu waja, kwavija heyo mwenyego kagatanga gaja gakalile mmioyo yao.<verse eid="JHN 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kolongelela na Nikodemo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1"/>Kukala na munhu yokemigwa Nikodemo, imwe wa wakulu wa Ikitala Kikulu cha Isi ya Wayahudi, yakalile Mfalisayo. <verse eid="JHN 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2"/>Kachola ha Yesu ikilo, kamulongela, “Mkulufunzi, tuvimanya kamba gweye kwa mkulufunzi ugaligwe na Mulungu. Kwavija haduhu munhu yondayadahe kutenda mizonza yuutenda kamba Mulungu hali hamoja na heyo.”<verse eid="JHN 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Nokulongela ikweli, munhu kamba havumbuke mwanza wa ikabili hadaha kuwona Undewa wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="JHN 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4"/>Nikodemo kamuuza, “Vodahikaze munhu m'vyele kuleligwa kabili? Havidahika kwingila muinda ya mamaake na kuvumbuka mwanza wa ikabili!”<verse eid="JHN 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Nokulongela ikweli, haduhu munhu yondayengile Muundewa wa Mulungu kamba havumbuke na mazi na Loho. <verse eid="JHN 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6"/>Kivumbuke na lukuli chowa lukuli, na kivumbuke na Loho wa Mulungu chowa loho. <verse eid="JHN 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7"/>Sambiukanganye kwavija nikulongela kamba mose molondigwa m'vumbuke kabili. <verse eid="JHN 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8"/>Ubeho ucholaga kuulonda, na mweye mohulika kisindo chake, ila mweye hamuutanga kuulawa ama kuuchola. Vivo ili na waja wose wavumbuke Muloho wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="JHN 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9"/>Nikodemo kauza, “Yowaze mbuli ino?”<verse eid="JHN 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Gweye kwa mkulufunzi muisi ya Islaeli, hugatangile gano? <verse eid="JHN 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11"/>Nokulongela ikweli, tolonga gaja tugamanyile na tosimulila gaja gatonile, ila haduhu munhu yoyose mmwanza wenu youtogola usenga wetu. <verse eid="JHN 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12"/>Niwalongela mbuli za muulumwengu na hamzitogola, motogolaze kamba nihawalongela mbuli za kuulanga? <verse eid="JHN 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13"/>Haduhu munhu yoyose yakwelile kuulanga ila ayo yahumuluke kulawa kuulanga, nie, Mwana wa Munhu.<verse eid="JHN 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14"/>“Kamba Musa viyamwinule nyoka kuluwala, vivija na Mwana wa Munhu kolondigwa yenuligwe, <verse eid="JHN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15"/>giladi yoyose yondayamtogole yeng'higwe ugima wa digunge. <verse eid="JHN 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16"/>Kwavija Mulungu kaunogela ulumwengu avo kamulava Mwanage imwe yeiyeka, giladi yoyose yondayamtogole sambiyadanganhike, ila yawe na ugima wa digunge. <verse eid="JHN 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17"/>Kwavija Mulungu hamgalile Mwanage muulumwengu yeze kuutagusa ulumwengu, ila ulumwengu ukomboligwe kubitila heyo.<verse eid="JHN 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18"/>“Awo womtogola Mwana hawatagusigwa. Ila awo woleka kumtogola wesha kutagusigwa, kwavija hawamtogole Mwana yeiyeka wa Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19"/>Na ino iyo nhaguso, mulangaza wiza muulumwengu, ila wanhu wanogelwa na ziza na kuwihila umulangaza, kwavija sang'hano zao ziha. <verse eid="JHN 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20"/>Awo wose wotenda mbuli zihile wowihila mulangaza, na haweza kuna umulangaza kwavija hawalonda mbuli zao zihile zoneke. <verse eid="JHN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21"/>Waja wotenda mbuli zinogile wokwiza kuna umulangaza, giladi yoneke kamba sang'hano zao zitendeka kubitila Mulungu.”<verse eid="JHN 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Usindila wa Yohana Yomulonga Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22"/>Abaho Yesu na wanahina zake wachola ng'ambu ya Yudea, kakala hiko mkipigiti kidodo na kubatiza. <verse eid="JHN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23"/>Yohana na heyo kakala yobatiza ako Ainoni behi na Salimu, kwavija hanhu haja kukala na mazi bwando. Wanhu wamgendela na heyo kawabatiza. <verse eid="JHN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24"/>Mbuli zino zilawilila kipigiti Yohana hanageligwa mkifungo.<verse eid="JHN 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25"/>Wanahina wa Yohana wasonga kuibamilila na Muyahudi imwe muimbuli ya nzoela ya kusuluza magulu na makono. <verse eid="JHN 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26"/>Avo wachola ha Yohana wamulongela, “Mkulufunzi, munhu ija yakalile na gweye mwambu wa ikabili wa Ulwanda lwa Yolodani, ija iumulongile kamba iyo Kilisto, na heyo kobatiza, na wanhu wose womgendela.”<verse eid="JHN 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27"/>Yohana kawalongela, “Haduhu munhu yodaha kupata kinhu chochose kamba hagweleligwe na Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28"/>Mweye wenyego iwo wasindila zangu haja hanilongile, ‘Nie sili Kilisto, ila nitumigwa nimulongole.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29"/>Mhambe mwenyego mulawilamhambe, mbwigaake mulawilamhambe kokwima na kumtegeleza mulawilamhambe, yahadihulika dizwi da mulawilamhambe kodeng'ha ng'hani. Avo sama ya kilamso kino ndeng'ha yangu ivikila. <verse eid="JHN 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30"/>Vinoga heyo yabanze na nie nihungule.”<verse eid="JHN 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayo Yokwiza Kulawa Kuulanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31"/>Ayo yezile kulawa uchana kawabanza wose. Ayo yezile kulawa muisi ka munhu wa muisi, na kolonga mbuli za muisi. Ila ayo yezile kulawa kuulanga kawabanza wose. <verse eid="JHN 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32"/>Kolonga gaja gayonile na kugahulika, ila haduhu munhu yozitogola mbuli zake. <verse eid="JHN 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33"/>Ila munhu yondayatogole mbuli zake kosindila kamba Mulungu iyo ikweli. <verse eid="JHN 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34"/>Munhu yatumigwe na Mulungu kopeta mbuli za Mulungu, kwavija Mulungu komgwelela Loho wake bila mhima. <verse eid="JHN 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35"/>Tata komnogela Mwana avo keka vinhu vose mmakono gake. <verse eid="JHN 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36"/>Munhu yoyose yomtogola Mwana kana ugima wa digunge, ila yoyose yomulema Mwana hawona ugima kwavija lusango lwa Mulungu lowa hamoja na heyo.<verse eid="JHN 3:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Mtwanzi wa Kisamalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1"/>Mafalisayo wahulika kamba Yesu kowapata na kuwabatiza wanahina bwando kum'banza Yohana. <verse eid="JHN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2"/>Ila Yesu mwenyego ham'batize munhu yoyose, ila wanahina zake wawo wabatize. <verse eid="JHN 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3"/>Yesu viyahulike gano, kasegela muisi ya Yudea kabwela muisi ya Galilaya, <verse eid="JHN 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4"/>kabita nzila ibitile muisi ya Samalia.<verse eid="JHN 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5"/>Kavika mkiwambo kimwe muisi ya Samalia kikemigwa Sikali, behi na mgunda wa Yakobo uyakalile yaamgwelele mwanage, Usufu. <verse eid="JHN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6"/>Haja kukala na sima da Yakobo, na Yesu, avija viyadonhile na umwanza, kakala hasi hamgwazo wa idisima. Ikala saa sita imisi.<verse eid="JHN 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7"/>Mtwanzi wa Kisamalia keza kudeha mazi, na Yesu kamulongela, “Nigwelele mazi ning'we.” <verse eid="JHN 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8"/>Wanahina zake wakala wacholile kukiwambo kugula mandia.<verse eid="JHN 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9"/>Ija imtwanzi kamulongela, “Gweye kwa Muyahudi na nie na mtwanzi wa Kisamalia, konipulaze nie mazi ga kung'wa?” Kwavija Wayahudi hawasangilaga vinhu na Wasamalia.<verse eid="JHN 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10"/>Yesu kedika, “Kamba uhaimanyile nhunza ya Mulungu na uhammanyile ayo yokupula mazi ga kung'wa, uhampulile heyo na yahakugwelele mazi golava ugima.”<verse eid="JHN 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11"/>Ija imtwanzi kalonga, “Mndewa, kia cha kudehela kwabule na sima digidila, kwahi kondaugapate mazi higo gali na ugima? <verse eid="JHN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12"/>Gweye kwa mkulu kum'banza muhenga wetu Yakobo yatugwelele sima dino, na heyo mwenyego na wanage na madale gake ga ng'hondolo wose wang'wa mazi ga sima dino?”<verse eid="JHN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Wanhu wose wong'wa mazi gano wokona ng'hilu kabili, <verse eid="JHN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14"/>ila munhu yoyose yondayang'we mazi gondanimgwelele nie honda yone ng'hilu kabili. Mazi gondanimgwelele nie gogaluka nzokwe mgati yake, gondagamgwelele ugima wa digunge.”<verse eid="JHN 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15"/>Ija imtwanzi kalonga, “Mndewa, ngwelela mazi higo! Giladi sambinyone ng'hilu kabili, na sambinize hano kudeha mazi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Genda kamkeme mbigalo wako, abaho, ubwele.”<verse eid="JHN 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17"/>Ija imtwanzi kedika, “Nabule mbigalo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Yesu kamulongela, “Kulonga goya avija vuulonga kwabule mbigalo. <verse eid="JHN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18"/>Kwavija kusoligwa na wambigalo watano, na mbigalo yuukala nayo sambi sio mbigalo wako. Kunongela ikweli.”<verse eid="JHN 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19"/>Ija imtwanzi kalonga, “Mndewa, nokona gweye kwa muhokozi. <verse eid="JHN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20"/>Wahenga zetu wakala wotambika mkigongo kino, ila mweye mogong'ondeza kamba Yelusalemu baho hanhu ha kutambikila.”<verse eid="JHN 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21"/>Yesu kamulongela ija imtwanzi, “Nhegeleza nie, go mtwanzi, kipigiti chokwiza wanhu hawamtambikila Tata mkigongo kino ama kuja Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22"/>Mweye motambikila kija hamkitangile, ila tweye tukitanga kija itukitambikila, kwavija ukombola wolawa mwa Wayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23"/>Ila kipigiti chokwiza na tena kipigiti kivika, watambika wa ikweli womtambikila Tata muloho na muikweli, kwavija Tata kowazahila wanhu wondawamtambikile kamba vino. <verse eid="JHN 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24"/>Mulungu iyo Loho, avo awo womtambikila wolondigwa wamtambikile muloho na muikweli.”<verse eid="JHN 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25"/>Ija imtwanzi kamulongela, “Nivitanga kamba Kilisto kokwiza, na yeheza, kotulongela kila kinhu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Nie, inilonga nagwe, iyo Kilisto.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27"/>Kipigiti kikija wanahina zake wabwela, wakanganya ng'hani viwam'vikile yolongelela na mtwanzi. Ila haduhu hata imwe mmwanza wao yamulongele, “Kolonda choni?” ama kumuuza Yesu, “Habali ulonga na mtwanzi ino?”<verse eid="JHN 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28"/>Abaho, ija imtwanzi kaleka nongo yake ya mazi, kabweleganya kukiwambo na kuwalongela wanhu wakalile haja. <verse eid="JHN 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29"/>Yolonga, “Izoni mmulole munhu yanongele kila kinhu kinhendile. Havidahika munhu ino kuwa iyo Kilisto?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30"/>Avo wasegela haja hakiwambo wachola kuyali Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31"/>Kipigiti kikija wanahina zake wamuyalalila Yesu wolonga, “Mkulufunzi, uje mandia.”<verse eid="JHN 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32"/>Ila heyo kawalongela, “Nie nnago mandia ago mweye hamgamanyile.”<verse eid="JHN 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33"/>Avo waja wanahina wasonga kukiiuza wenyego kwa wenyego, “Hana munhu yamgalile mandia?”<verse eid="JHN 4:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mandia gangu nie gago gano, kugatenda gaja gamnogele ayo yanhumile na kuimambukiza sang'hano yake. <verse eid="JHN 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35"/>Mnawo ulonzi ulonga, ‘Isigala milenge mine mulao ulawe.’ Ila nie nowalongela, loleni mmigunda, vakuja vipa visha avo volondigwa kuhunigwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36"/>Muhuna vakuja kogendelela kulihigwa hata sambi, na heyo kokunzanya ivakuja yavike muugima wa digunge, avo yahandile na ayo yohuna wodeng'ha hamoja. <verse eid="JHN 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37"/>Kamba ulonzi uno vuulonga, ‘Imwe kohanda, iyagwe kohuna.’ <verse eid="JHN 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38"/>Niwagala kuhuna vakuja mumgunda hamuulimile. Wanhu wayagwe iwo wasang'hanike, na mweye mpata fong'ha kulawa msang'hano yao.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39"/>Wasamalia bwando kulawa mkiwambo kija wamtogola Yesu, sama ya gaja gayalongile ija imtwanzi, “Kanongela kila kinhu kinhendile.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40"/>Avo waja Wasamalia viwamwizile, wamuyalalila yakale na hewo, avo Yesu kakala haja mazua mabili.<verse eid="JHN 4:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41"/>Wanhu wayagwe bwando wamtogola sama ya mbuli zake, <verse eid="JHN 4:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42"/>na wamulongela ija imtwanzi, “Tutogola si kwavija gweye kutulongela, ila kwavija tumuhulika tweye wenyego, na tuvitanga kamba heyo iyo Mkombola wa ulumwengu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Komuhonya Mwana wa Mkulu wa Silikali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43"/>Vigabitile mazua mabili, Yesu kasegela haja kachola kuisi ya Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44"/>Kwavija heyo mwenyego kalonga, “Muhokozi hahishimilwa muisi yake mwenyego.” <verse eid="JHN 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45"/>Viyavikile Galilaya wanhu wa haja wam'bokela, kwavija wavona vinhu vose viyatendile Yelusalemu, kipigiti cha Ulusona lwa Pasaka, kwavija na hewo wakala wacholile kuna ulusona.<verse eid="JHN 4:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46"/>Abaho, Yesu kabweleganya kuna ikiwambo cha Kana muisi ya Galilaya, ako kuyagalule mazi kuwa divai. Haja kukala na mkulu imwe wa silikali yakalile na mwanage mtamu ako Kapenaumu. <verse eid="JHN 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47"/>Viyahulike kamba Yesu keza kulawa Yudea kwiza Galilaya, kamgendela na kumuyalalila yachole Kapenaumu yakamuhonye mwanage yakalile behi na kudanganhika. <verse eid="JHN 4:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Kamba hamonile vilaguso na mikanganyo, hamtogola.”<verse eid="JHN 4:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49"/>Ija imkulu wa silikali kamulongela, “Mndewa, izo kipigiti mwanangu hanadanganhika.”<verse eid="JHN 4:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Genda ukae yako, na mwanago kohona.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Ija imkulu wa silikali kazitogola mbuli za Yesu, avo kachola. <verse eid="JHN 4:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51"/>Viyakalile yobwela ukae, mnzila kaiting'hana na nyakadala zake, wamulongela, “Mwanago kahona.”<verse eid="JHN 4:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52"/>Kawauza kipigiti kilihi mwanage chayahonile, wamulongela, “Ikala saa saba imisi mayo homa imsegela.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53"/>Avo ija tata wa imwana kakumbukila kamba kikala kipigiti kikija Yesu chayamulongele, “Mwanago kohona.” Avo heyo na mulango wake wose wamtogola Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54"/>Uno ukala mzonza wa ikabili waatendile Yesu viyalawile Yudea kuchola Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 4:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Uhonyaji hana Dibwawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1"/>Abaho, Yesu kachola Yelusalemu kuna ulusona lwa Wayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2"/>Kuja Yelusalemu, behi na Lwivi lwa Ng'hondolo, kukala na bwawa dikemigwa Mkieblania “Betizata,” dikalile na mhelengo tano. <verse eid="JHN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3"/>Wanhu bwando wakalile watamu wakala wowasa mmhelengo zija, vimbugumbugu, mbetembete, na wanhu waholole wakala wobeta mazi gatibuke. <verse eid="JHN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4"/>Kwavija watogola kamba kuna kipigiti msenga wa Mndewa wa kuulanga kohumuluka mdibwawa na kugatibula gamazi. Na mtamu wa ichanduso kwingila mdibwawa kipigiti msenga wa Mulungu yehesha kugatibula, kohonyigwa utamu wose uyalinao. <verse eid="JHN 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5"/>Haja kukala na munhu yakalile mtamu mmilao malongo madatu na minane. <verse eid="JHN 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6"/>Yesu viyamonile munhu ija kawasa haja na viyavitangile kamba munhu ija kakala mtamu mkipigiti kitali, kamuuza, “Kolonda kuwa mgima?”<figure style="fig" alt="Pool of Bethesda healing" file="WA03828b.jpg" size="col" loc="John 5:5-7" copy="Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989." ref="Yoh. 5:6"/><verse eid="JHN 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7"/>Ija imtamu kamwidika, “Mndewa, nie nabule munhu hano wa kunigela mdibwawa kipigiti mazi gahatibuligwa. Nihalonda kwingila, munhu iyagwe konilongola.”<verse eid="JHN 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Ima wima, papa lusazi lwako utembele.” <verse eid="JHN 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9"/>Bahaja ija imunhu kahona, kapapa lusazi lwake, kasonga kuchola.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Mbuli ino ilawilila Mdizua da Mhumulo. <verse eid="JHN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10"/>Avo wakulu wa Wayahudi wamulongela ija imunhu yahonyigwe, “Lelo Zua da Mhumulo, malagizo getu gokugomesa gweye kupapa lusazi lwako.”<verse eid="JHN 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11"/>Na heyo kawalongela, “Ija munhu yanihonyile kanilongela, ‘Papa lusazi lwako uchole.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12"/>Wamuuza, “Iyo munhu yalihi yakulongele upape lusazi lwako uchole?”<verse eid="JHN 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13"/>Ila ija imunhu yahonyigwe kakala hamtangile kakala munhu yalihi, kwavija Yesu kakala yengile mdidale da wanhu dikalile haja.<verse eid="JHN 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14"/>Mkipigiti kiguhi hamwande, Yesu kam'vika ija imunhu Kuing'anda ya Mulungu, kamulongela, “Tegeleza, sambi kuhona, avo sambiutende vilozo kabili, ama vokulawilila vinhu viyagwe vihile ng'hani kubanza vino.”<verse eid="JHN 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15"/>Abaho, ija imunhu kachola kuwalongela wakulu wa Wayahudi kamba Yesu iyo yamuhonyile. <verse eid="JHN 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16"/>Avo wasonga kumgaza Yesu kwavija kahonya Mdizua da Mhumulo. <verse eid="JHN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Tataangu kosang'hanika mazua gose, na nie vivija nosang'hanika.”<verse eid="JHN 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18"/>Sama ya kilamso kino wakulu wa Wayahudi wazahila ng'hani nzila ya kumkomela, sio kwavija katenda gagomeswe Mdizua da Mhumulo, ila vivija kamkema Mulungu Tataake, avo kaitenda heyo kalinga na Mulungu.<verse eid="JHN 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Udaho wa Mwana wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19"/>Avo Yesu kawedika yolonga, “Nowalongela ikweli, Mwana hadaha kutenda chochose heyo mwenyego, ila kotenda kija choyomona Tataake yotenda. Kija choyotenda Tata, kicho vivija Mwana choyotenda. <verse eid="JHN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20"/>Kwavija Tata komnogela Mwanage na kamulagusila vinhu vose voyotenda heyo. Komulagusila vinhu vikulu ng'hani kubanza vino, na mweye mose mokwiza kukanganya. <verse eid="JHN 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21"/>Kamba vija Tata viyozusa wadanganhike na kuwabwezela ugima, vivija na Mwana kowabwezela ugima waja yoolonda kuwabwezela. <verse eid="JHN 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22"/>Tata hamtagusa munhu yoyose. Ila kamgwelela Mwanage udaho wose wa kutagusa, <verse eid="JHN 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23"/>giladi wanhu wose wamuhishimile Mwana kamba vija viwomuhishimila Tata. Munhu yoyose yondayaleke kumuhishimila Mwana, vivija hamuhishimila Tata yamtumile.<verse eid="JHN 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24"/>“Nowalongela ikweli, munhu yoyose yondayazihulike mbuli zangu na kumtogola ayo yanhumile nie kana ugima wa digunge. Hatagusigwa, ila kabita kulawa mkudanganhika kengila muugima. <verse eid="JHN 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25"/>Nowalongela ikweli, kipigiti chokwiza na kipigiti kivika aho wanhu wadanganhike wodihulika dizwi da nie, Mwana wa Mulungu, na awo wondawadihulike wowa wagima. <verse eid="JHN 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26"/>Kamba vija Tata viyali na ugima mgati yake mwenyego, vivija kamtenda Mwanage yawe na ugima mgati yake mwenyego. <verse eid="JHN 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27"/>Na kanigwelela udaho wa kutagusa kwavija nie iyo Mwana wa Munhu. <verse eid="JHN 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28"/>Sambimkanganye mbuli ino, kipigiti chokwiza aho wanhu wali mgamapanga vondawahulike dizwi jangu, <verse eid="JHN 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29"/>na kulawa hanze ya igamapanga, awo watendile ganogile wozuka giladi wagweleligwe ugima wa digunge, na awo watendile gehile wozuka giladi wakehigwe.<verse eid="JHN 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Usindila wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30"/>“Nie sidaha kutenda kinhu chochose nene mwenyego, notagusa kamba vinihulika. Nhaguso yangu yabule uzenzeleganye, kwavija sizahila kuinogeza mwenyego ila kumnogeza ayo yanhumile.<verse eid="JHN 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31"/>“Kamba nihaisindila mwenyego, usindila wangu hautogoligwa kamba kweli. <verse eid="JHN 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32"/>Ila hana munhu iyagwe yonisindila nie, na munhu hiyo iyo Yohana, na nie nivitanga kamba gaja goyolonga gotogoligwa kamba kweli. <verse eid="JHN 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33"/>Muwatuma wasenga zenu ha Yohana, na heyo kawalongela ikweli yose. <verse eid="JHN 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34"/>Nie silonda usindila kulawa mwa wanhu, ila nilonga gano giladi mkomboligwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35"/>Yohana kakala kamba kiwenge kilukula na kulava mulangaza, na mweye mulonda kudeng'helela mulangaza wake mkipigiti kiguhi. <verse eid="JHN 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36"/>Ila nie nna usindila mkulu ng'hani kubanza usindila yaawagwelele Yohana. Kwavija sang'hano ino initenda yaangwelele Tata niimambukize, ino inigendelela kuitenda, yolagusa kamba Tata iyo yanhumile. <verse eid="JHN 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37"/>Tataangu yanhumile vivija mwenyego kasindila sama yangu. Hamdihulike dizwi jake ama kuchona kiwiliwili chake, <verse eid="JHN 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38"/>na hamzikile mbuli zake mmioyo yenu, kwavija hamumtogole ayo iyamtumile. <verse eid="JHN 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39"/>Mozihimbula ng'hani Nyandiko Zing'alile, kwavija mokwagiza kamba mkutenda vino mokwing'higwa ugima wa digunge. Na Nyandiko Zing'alile zimuhimbula zizo zinilonga nie! <verse eid="JHN 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40"/>Hata avo hamulonda kwiza kumwangu giladi mpate ugima.<verse eid="JHN 5:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41"/>“Nie sizizahila nhogolwa kulawa mwa wanhu. <verse eid="JHN 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42"/>Ila niwamanya mweye mwa wanhu wa vilihi. Nivitanga kamba mweye mwabule noge da Mulungu mmioyo yenu. <verse eid="JHN 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43"/>Nie niza mtwaga da Tataangu, ila mweye hamunibokele. Ila kamba munhu yeheza mtwaga jake mwenyego, mom'bokela. <verse eid="JHN 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44"/>Kamba mweye mobokela nhogolwa zilawa mmwenu mwemwe wenyego, ila hamuiyoha mpate nhogolwa zilawa ha Mulungu yeiyeka, avo modahaze kutogola? <verse eid="JHN 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45"/>Sambimgelegeze kamba nie niza kuwatagusa ha Tata. Musa, imumtamanila, iyo yondayawataguse mweye. <verse eid="JHN 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46"/>Kamba mweye mumtogola Musa, muhanitogole nie, kwavija kandika mbuli zangu. <verse eid="JHN 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47"/>Ila kamba hamgatogole gaja gayandike, mogatogolaze gonilonga?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kowegutiza Wanhu Alufu Tano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat. 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mlk. 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk. 9:10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1"/>Abaho Yesu kaloka Lamba da Galilaya, ama vivija vowodikemaga Lamba da Tibelia. <verse eid="JHN 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2"/>Dale kulu da wanhu dimkweleleza, kwavija wayona mizonza iyatendile mwa watamu. <verse eid="JHN 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3"/>Yesu kakwela hakigongo, kakala hasi na wanahina zake. <verse eid="JHN 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4"/>Kipigiti cha Lusona lwa Wayahudi lukemigwa Pasaka kikwenhuka. <verse eid="JHN 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5"/>Yesu kalola uchana kona dale kulu da wanhu domwizila, kamulongela Filipo, “Tukagule kwahi mikate ya kuwegutiza wanhu wose wano?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6"/>Kalonga gano giladi yamgeze, kwavija mwenyego kavimanya vija vondayatende.<verse eid="JHN 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7"/>Filipo kamwidika kalonga, “Kitumetume cha milenge minane hakidaha kugula mikate ya kumtenda kila imwe yapate kikate kidodo.”<verse eid="JHN 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8"/>Mwanahina wake iyagwe yokemigwa Endelea, mkulu wake Simoni, ayo vivija yokemigwa Petulo, kalonga, <verse eid="JHN 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9"/>“Hana mmhale hano kana mikate mitano ya mpunga na visomba vibili. Ila wangahi wondawaje mdidale dino jose?”<verse eid="JHN 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10"/>Yesu kalonga, “Walongeleni wanhu wakale hasi.” Haja kukala na visoti bwando. Avo wanhu wose wakala hasi, na wanhu wakalile haja wakala kamba wambigalo alufu tano vino. <verse eid="JHN 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11"/>Abaho Yesu kaisola ija imikate, kamgwaa Mulungu hewela, kawagolela wanhu wakalile haja kamba viwalondile. Katenda vivija na ivisomba. <verse eid="JHN 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12"/>Wanhu wose viweigute, kawalongela wanahina zake, “Dondoleni ividanga va imikate isigale, sambikipotele chochose.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13"/>Avo wavidondola na kumemeza migelo longo dimwe na mibili imemile vidanga va imikate ya mpunga isigale iwadile iwanhu.<verse eid="JHN 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14"/>Wanhu viwonile mzonza uno waatendile Yesu, walonga, “Kweli ino iyo Muhokozi yalongigwe kokwiza muulumwengu.” <verse eid="JHN 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15"/>Yesu kavitanga kamba wakala mmabehi kwiza kumgoga wamtende mndewa wao kwa shuluti, avo kasegela kabweleganya kukigongo yeiyeka.<verse eid="JHN 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kotembela Uchana ya Igamazi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat. 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mlk. 6:45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16"/>Viivikile ichungulo, wanahina zake Yesu wahumuluka kudilamba, <verse eid="JHN 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17"/>kilo vukisongile kwingila na Yesu kakala yang'hali hanabwela, wakwela mngalawa na kusonga kuloka idilamba wochola Kapenaumu. <verse eid="JHN 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18"/>Kukuzumbi dilawilila, na gamazi gasonga kutibuka. <verse eid="JHN 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19"/>Wanahina viwakalile wogela ng'hafi mwanza wa kilometa tano ama sita, wamona yesu yotembela uchana ya igamazi, yokwiza behi na ingalawa. Avo, wadumba ng'hani. <verse eid="JHN 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Sambimdumbe, nie iyo.” <verse eid="JHN 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21"/>Avo wam'bokela mkudeng'ha, kengila mngalawa, na kipigiti kikija ingalawa ivika mulusanga, bahaja hawakalile wochola.<verse eid="JHN 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wanhu Womzahila Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22"/>Zua da ikabili wanhu bwando wakalile mwambu wa ikabili wa idilamba wakumbukila kamba haja kukala na ngalawa imwe, na Yesu hacholile na wanahina zake mngalawa ija, ila wachola weiyeka. <verse eid="JHN 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23"/>Ngalawa ziyagwe zikalile zizile kulawa kiwambo cha Tibelia zivika behi na hanhu haja wanhu hawadile imikate, Mndewa viyeshile kumgwaa hewela Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24"/>Wanhu viwonile kamba Yesu na wanahina zake wahaduhu, wengila mzingalawa zija, wachola Kapenaumu kumzahila Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Iyo Mandia ga Ugima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25"/>Wanhu viwam'vikile Yesu mwambu wa ikabili wa idilamba, wamulongela, “Mkulufunzi, kwiza zua jaki hano?”<verse eid="JHN 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Nowalongela ikweli, monizahila si kwavija vumuyonile imizonza, ila kwavija muja imikate na kupata gaja gamulondile. <verse eid="JHN 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27"/>Sambimsang'hanikile ng'hani mandia gaja gobanangika, ila sang'hanikileni mandia gondagakale mbaka kuugima wa digunge, ago nie, Mwana wa Munhu gondaniwagwelele. Mwa heyo Mulungu Tata keka kilagilo chake.”<verse eid="JHN 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28"/>Abaho wamuuza, “Tutendeze giladi tugatende gaja Mulungu goyolonda tweye tugatende?”<verse eid="JHN 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Kino kicho Mulungu choyolonda mumsang'hanikile, mumtogole ayo iyamtumile.”<verse eid="JHN 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30"/>Wamulongela, “Mzonza ulihi wondauutende tuwone, giladi tukutogole? Kotenda kinhu kilihi? <verse eid="JHN 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31"/>Wahenga zetu waja mana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:31 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Mana </char><char style="ft" closed="false">iyo chakuja kilingile na mkate kiyalagaze Mulungu kulawa kuulanga kipigiti Waislaeli viwakalile muluwala.</char></note> muluwala, kamba Zinyandiko Zing'alile vuzilonga, ‘Kawagwelela mkate kulawa kuulanga waje.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Nowalongela ikweli, sio Musa yawagwelele mkate kulawa kuulanga, ila Tataangu iyo yowagwelela mkate wa ikweli kulawa kuulanga. <verse eid="JHN 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33"/>Kwavija mkate wa Mulungu uwo heyo yohumuluka kulawa kuulanga, yolava ugima muulumwengu.”<verse eid="JHN 6:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34"/>Wamulongela, “Mndewa, tugwelele mkate uno mazua gose.”<verse eid="JHN 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Nie iyo mkate wa ugima. Yoyose yondayeze kumwangu heza kona nzala, na yoyose yondayanitogole heza kona ng'hilu. <verse eid="JHN 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36"/>Ila kamba viniwalongele, munyona ila hamunitogola. <verse eid="JHN 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37"/>Wose waangwelele Tataangu wokwiza kumwangu, na yoyose yondayeze kumwangu simuwinga. <verse eid="JHN 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38"/>Kwavija nihumuluka kulawa kuulanga kutenda gaja goyolonda ayo yanhumile, na sio kutenda gaja ganilonda nie. <verse eid="JHN 6:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39"/>Na gano gago goyolonda ija yanhumile, sambinimwase munhu yoyose mmwanza wa waja waanigwelele, ila nolondigwa niwazuse wose wawe wagima mdizua da ikimambukizo. <verse eid="JHN 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40"/>Kwavija choyolonda Tataangu icho kino, wose wondawamone Mwana na kumtogola wopata ugima wa digunge. Na nowazusa wawe wagima mdizua da ikimambukizo.”<verse eid="JHN 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41"/>Wayahudi wasonga kumtwanganikila, kwavija kalonga, “Nie iyo mkate uhumuluke kulawa kuulanga.” <verse eid="JHN 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42"/>Walonga, “Munhu ino hali Yesu, mwanage Usufu? Tumtanga tataake na mamaake. Avo kolongaze kahumuluka kulawa kuulanga?”<verse eid="JHN 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43"/>Yesu kawedika, “Sambimtwanganike wenyego kwa wenyego. <verse eid="JHN 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44"/>Haduhu munhu yodaha kwiza kumwangu kamba hakwegigwe na Tataangu yanhumile nie, na nie nomzusa yawe mgima mdizua da ikimambukizo. <verse eid="JHN 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45"/>Wahokozi wandika, ‘Wanhu wose wofundizigwa na Mulungu.’ Munhu yoyose yomuhulika Tata na kuifundiza kumwake kokwiza kumwangu. <verse eid="JHN 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46"/>Haduhu munhu yamonile Tata, ila ayo yalawile ha Mulungu iyo yeiyeka yamonile Tata. <verse eid="JHN 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47"/>Nowalongela ikweli, ayo yondayatogole kana ugima wa digunge. <verse eid="JHN 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48"/>Nie iyo umkate wa ugima. <verse eid="JHN 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49"/>Wahenga zenu waja mana muluwala, ila wadanganhika. <verse eid="JHN 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50"/>Ila uno uwo mkate uhumuluka kulawa kuulanga, awo munhu youja hadanganhika. <verse eid="JHN 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51"/>Nie iyo mkate uli na ugima uhumuluke kulawa kuulanga. Kamba munhu yoyose yahauja mkate uno, kowa na ugima wa digunge. Mkate wondanimgwelele uwo lukuli lwangu nilulava giladi ulumwengu uwe na ugima.”<verse eid="JHN 6:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52"/>Wayahudi wasonga kuibamilila ng'hani wenyego kwa wenyego wolonga, “Vodahikaze munhu ino yatugwelele lukuli lwake tuluje?”<verse eid="JHN 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Nowalongela ikweli, kamba hamuludile lukuli lwa nie, Mwana wa Munhu, na kuung'wa mulopa wangu, mowa bule ugima mgati yenu. <verse eid="JHN 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54"/>Awo woja lukuli lwangu na kuung'wa mulopa wangu wana ugima wa digunge, na nowazusa wawe wagima mdizua da hakimambukizo. <verse eid="JHN 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55"/>Kwavija lukuli lwangu lulo mandia ga ikweli, na mulopa wangu uwo ung'waji wa ikweli. <verse eid="JHN 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56"/>Yoyose yondayaluje lukuli lwangu na kuung'wa mulopa wangu kokala mgati yangu, na nie nokala mgati yake. <verse eid="JHN 6:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57"/>Tata mwene ugima iyo yanhumile, na sama yake na nie nnao ugima. Vivija munhu yoyose yondayanije kowa na ugima sama yangu nie. <verse eid="JHN 6:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58"/>Uno uwo mkate uhumuluke kulawa kuulanga. Wahenga zenu waja mana na viwadanganhike hawapatile ugima wa digunge. Ila awo wondawaje mkate uno wowa na ugima wa digunge.”<verse eid="JHN 6:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59"/>Yesu kagalonga gano viyakalile yofundiza mng'anda ya nhambiko ako Kapenaumu.<verse eid="JHN 6:59"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuli za Ugima wa Digunge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60"/>Wanahina zake bwando viwahulike gano walonga, “Mafundo gano magaga. Yalihi yondayadahe kugabokela?”<verse eid="JHN 6:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61"/>Yesu kavitanga kamba wakala woitwanganikila mbuli ino, kawalongela, “Mbuli ino iwagevuza? <verse eid="JHN 6:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62"/>Yowaze kamba muhanyona nie, Mwana wa Munhu, nikwinuligwa kubweleganya kunikalile haichanduso? <verse eid="JHN 6:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63"/>Yagelaga ugima iyo Loho, mhiko za wanhu hazidaha chochose. Mbuli iniwalongele iyo Loho wa Mulungu yolava ugima. <verse eid="JHN 6:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64"/>Hata avo hana wanhu mmwanza wenu hawagatogola.” Songela haichanduso Yesu kavitanga wanhu walihi wakalile hawamtogola na munhu yalihi yondayamuhonze. <verse eid="JHN 6:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65"/>Abaho, kongeza kulonga, “Kino kicho kilamso cha kuwalongela kamba haduhu munhu yondayeze kumwangu kamba hagaligwe na Tata.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66"/>Sama ya mbuli zino, wanahina zake bwando wabweleganya kuchugu, avo waleka kumkweleleza. <verse eid="JHN 6:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67"/>Avo Yesu kawauza waja wanahina zake longo dimwe na wabili, “Na mweye vivija molonda kusegela?”<verse eid="JHN 6:67"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68"/>Simoni Petulo kamulongela, “Mndewa, tuchole ha munhu yalihi? Gweye kuna mbuli zili na ugima wa digunge. <verse eid="JHN 6:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69"/>Na sambi tutogola na kuvitanga kamba gweye iyo Ung'alile wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="JHN 6:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70"/>Yesu kamwidika yolonga, “Siwasagule mweye longo dimwe na wabili? Hata avo imwe mmwanza wenu Mwenembago!” <verse eid="JHN 6:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71"/>Kakala yagalongile gano yomulonga Yuda mwanage Simoni Isikalioti, ayo yakalile mmwanza wa wanahina longo dimwe na wabili, ayo hamwande yamuhonzile Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 6:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Wadodo Zake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1"/>Abaho Yesu kakala yotembela muiisi ya Galilaya. Halondile kutembela muiisi ya Yudea kwavija wakulu wa Wayahudi wakala wolonda kumkoma. <verse eid="JHN 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2"/>Lusona lwa Vizewe lwa Wayahudi lukala lukwenhuke, <verse eid="JHN 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3"/>avo wandugu zake Yesu wamulongela, “Segela hano uchole Yudea, giladi wanahina zako wazone sang'hano zuutenda. <verse eid="JHN 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4"/>Haduhu munhu yofisa mbuli zoyotenda kamba yahalonda kutangigwa na wanhu. Kamba kotenda mbuli zino, uilaguse muulumwengu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5"/>Kwavija hata wandugu zake hawamtogole.<verse eid="JHN 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Kipigiti changu kinogile hakinavika, ila vipigiti vose kumwenu mweye vinoga. <verse eid="JHN 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7"/>Ulumwengu haudaha kuwehila mweye, ila wonihila nie, kwavija mazua gose noulongela kamba sang'hano zake ziha. <verse eid="JHN 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8"/>Mweye gendeni kulusona. Nie sichola kuna ulusona, kwavija kipigiti changu kinogile hakinavikila.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9"/>Viyamambukize kugalonga gano, kagendelela kukala muiisi ya Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kulusona lwa Ivizewe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10"/>Wadodo zake viwacholile kulusona, Yesu na heyo kachola, ila hacholile mkuilagusa, ila mkuifisa. <verse eid="JHN 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11"/>Wakulu wa Wayahudi wakala womzahila kuja kulusona, wauza, “Kakwahi?”<verse eid="JHN 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12"/>Kukala na nyong'onyo bwando mwa wanhu womnyong'onya heyo. Wanhu wayagwe walonga, “Munhu ino kanoga,” wayagwe walonga, “Hanogile, kowagiza wanhu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13"/>Ila haduhu yamulongile kinaganaga kwavija wakala wowadumba wakulu wa Wayahudi.<verse eid="JHN 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14"/>Lusona vuluvikile mkindibwindibwi, Yesu kachola Kung'anda ya Mulungu na kusonga kufundiza. <verse eid="JHN 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15"/>Wakulu wa Wayahudi wakanganya ng'hani walonga, “Munhu ino kozitangaze mbuli zino zose na kuno hafundizigwe na munhu yoyose?”<verse eid="JHN 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16"/>Yesu kalonga, “Kinifundiza nie sio mafundo gangu mwenyego, ila galawa ha Mulungu yanhumile. <verse eid="JHN 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17"/>Munhu yoyose yosagula kugatenda gaja goyolonda Mulungu kovitanga kamba gano gonifundiza nie golawa ha Mulungu ama nolonga mbuli zangu mwenyego. <verse eid="JHN 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18"/>Munhu yolonga mbuli zake mwenyego kozahila nhogolwa yake mwenyego. Ila munhu yosang'hanika sama ya nhogolwa ya ayo yamtumile iyo mwene ikweli, na mduhu dihile mgati yake. <verse eid="JHN 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19"/>Musa hawagwelele Malagizo? Na haduhu hata munhu imwe mmwanza wenu yogazindilila Malagizo. Habali mulonda kunikoma?”<verse eid="JHN 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20"/>Waja wanhu walonga, “Gweye kuna Mwenembago! Yalihi yondakukukoma?”<verse eid="JHN 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Nitenda mzonza umwe,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hano Yesu kowakumbusa wanhu mzonza uyamtendele munhu yaholole Mdizua da Mhumulo muisula ya </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 5:1-18">5:1-18</ref></char>.</note> na mose msinhuka. <verse eid="JHN 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22"/>Musa kawalagiza mweye muwengize kumbi wanenu. Hata avo sio Musa yasongile mbuli ino ila wahenga zenu. Avo mumwingiza kumbi mwana Mdizua da Mhumulo. <verse eid="JHN 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23"/>Kamba mwana kengizigwa kumbi Mdizua da Mhumulo giladi Malagizo ga Musa sambigadulukwe, habali basi munyonela lusango nie kwavija nimuhonya munhu utamu wake wose Mdizua da Mhumulo? <verse eid="JHN 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24"/>Sambimumtaguse munhu kwavija voyoneka, ila mtaguseni muikweli.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Iyo Kilisto?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25"/>Wanhu wayagwe wa Yelusalemu walonga, “Ino hali munhu ija woyolonda kumkoma? <verse eid="JHN 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26"/>Lola, kolongelela hakimwagaia, na wakulu hawalonga kinhu chochose cha kumtagusa. Yokoneka wavitanga kamba heyo iyo Kilisto? <verse eid="JHN 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27"/>Ila Kilisto vondayeze haduhu munhu yondayavitange koyolawa. Ila tweye tose tukutanga koyolawa munhu ino.”<verse eid="JHN 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28"/>Yesu viyakalile yofundiza Kung'anda ya Mulungu, kenula dizwi yolonga, “Nie munitanga na mkutanga kuja kunilawa. Sizile na udaho wangu mwenyego. Ayo yanhumile kabule uzenzeleganye, na mweye hamumtangile. <verse eid="JHN 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29"/>Ila nie nimtanga, kwavija niza kulawa kumwake, na heyo iyo yanhumile nie.”<verse eid="JHN 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30"/>Avo, walonda kumgoga, ila haduhu munhu yamgolosele mkono wake, kwavija kipigiti chake kikala hakinavika. <verse eid="JHN 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31"/>Wanhu bwando wakalile mdidale dija wamtogola, walonga, “Kipigiti chondayeze Kilisto, kotenda mizonza kubanza ino yootenda munhu ino?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wemilizi Wotumigwa Wakamgoge Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32"/>Mafalisayo wawahulika wanhu wonyong'onya mbuli zija womulonga Yesu, avo hewo na wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko wawatuma wemilizi wa Ng'anda ya Mulungu wakamgoge. <verse eid="JHN 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33"/>Yesu kalonga, “Nokala na mweye mkipigiti kidodo, abaho, nobwela ha ayo yanhumile. <verse eid="JHN 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34"/>Monizahila ila hamunyona, na kondaniwe hamdaha kwiza.”<verse eid="JHN 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35"/>Wakulu wa Wayahudi wakiilongela wenyego kwa wenyego, wolonga, “Kwahi koyolonda kuchola kondatuleke kumona? Konda kuchola kuwapwililikile wanhu zetu muisi ya Ugiliki na kuwafundiza Wagiliki? <verse eid="JHN 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36"/>Mbuli ino nhegulo yake choni ahaja hayolongile, ‘Monizahila, ila hamunyona’ na ‘Kondaniwe, hamdaha kwiza’?”<verse eid="JHN 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lwanda lwa Mazi Golava Ugima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37"/>Zua da mgotoko wa ulusona dikala zua dinogelwe ng'hani na wanhu. Yesu kema kenula dizwi kalonga, “Munhu yoyose yali na ng'hilu na yeze kumwangu yang'we, <verse eid="JHN 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38"/>munhu yoyose yonitogola, kamba Nyandiko Zing'alile vuzilongile, ‘Lwanda lwa mazi golava ugima gotililika kulawa mmoyo wake.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39"/>Mazi gayalongile Yesu gakala Loho wa Mulungu, ayo waja wamtogole heyo wom'bokela. Kipigiti kija Loho wa Mulungu kakala yang'hali hanavika, kwavija Yesu kakala yang'hali hanayenzigwa.<verse eid="JHN 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wanhu Wokiigola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40"/>Wanhu wayagwe wakalile mdidale dija wamuhulike Yesu yolonga gano walonga, “Munhu ino kweli iyo Muhokozi ija.”<verse eid="JHN 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41"/>Wayagwe walonga, “Ino iyo Kilisto.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:41">Ila wayagwe walonga, “Vodahikaze Kilisto yalawe muisi ya Galilaya? <verse eid="JHN 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42"/>Nyandiko Zing'alile hazilonga kamba Kilisto kokwiza kulawa mulukolo lwa Daudi, na kovumbuka muisi ya Betelehemu, kiwambo chayakalile yokala Daudi?” <verse eid="JHN 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43"/>Avo wanhu wakiigola sama ya Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44"/>Wayagwe walonda kumgoga, ila haduhu yamgolosele mkono.<verse eid="JHN 7:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wakulu wa Wayahudi Wolema Kumtogola Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45"/>Wemilizi wabwela ha wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko na Mafalisayo, na hewo wawauza, “Habali hamumgogile?”<verse eid="JHN 7:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46"/>Wemilizi walonga, “Hatunamona munhu yolonga kamba viyolonga munhu ino!”<verse eid="JHN 7:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47"/>Mafalisayo wawauza, “Na mweye vivija kawavwizila? <verse eid="JHN 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48"/>Mmona munhu yoyose mmwanza wa wakulu wa wanhu ama Mfalisayo imwe yomtogola ino? <verse eid="JHN 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49"/>Wanhu wano womuwinza ino hawagatangile Malagizo ga Musa, avo wokiigela mulusango lwa Mulungu!”<verse eid="JHN 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50"/>Imwe wa Mafalisayo wakalile haja kakala Nikodemo, munhu yacholile kumona Yesu mazua ga kuchugu, kauza, <verse eid="JHN 7:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51"/>“Malagizo hagalonga kamba havidahika kumtagusa munhu yoyose kamba hatunamuhulika na kugatanga gaja gayatendile?”<verse eid="JHN 7:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52"/>Walonga, “Gweye vivija kolawa Galilaya? Pelesa Zinyandiko Zing'alile na kokwiza kona kamba haduhu muhokozi yondayeze kulawa Galilaya.” <verse eid="JHN 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53"/>Abaho, kila munhu kachola ukae yake.<verse eid="JHN 7:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Mtwanzi Yagogigwe Muugoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1"/>Ila Yesu kachola Kukigongo cha Mizaituni. <verse eid="JHN 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2"/>Imitondo ng'hani zua da ikabili kabweleganya Kung'anda ya Mulungu. Wanhu wose waiting'hana womzunguluka, na heyo kakala hasi kasonga kuwafundiza. <verse eid="JHN 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3"/>Wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo wamgalila mtwanzi yagogigwe muugoni. Wamwika haulongozi wao, <verse eid="JHN 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4"/>wamulongela, “Mkulufunzi, mtwanzi ino kagogigwa hadibugo yotenda ugoni. <verse eid="JHN 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5"/>Muna Gamalagizo, Musa katulagiza kamba, watwanzi kamba wano watoigwe na mabwe mbaka wadanganhike. Avo gweye kolongaze?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6"/>Wagalonga gano womwikila vitega Yesu giladi weze kumtagusa. Ila heyo kainamila yokwandika muisi na kidole chake.<verse eid="JHN 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7"/>Waja wanhu wemile haja viwabanzilize kumuuzagiza, Yesu kenuka kawalongela, “Munhu yoyose mmwanza wenu yalibule vilozo yawe waichanduso kumwasila dibwe.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8"/>Abaho, kainamila kabili yokwandika muna iisi. <verse eid="JHN 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9"/>Viwahulike gano, wose wasegela imweimwe, kusongela iwakulu mbaka iwadodo, kasigala Yesu yeiyeka na ija imtwanzi yemile bahaja. <verse eid="JHN 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10"/>Kenuka kamulongela ija imtwanzi, “Wakwahi? Haduhu hata imwe yakutaguse?”<verse eid="JHN 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11"/>Ija imtwanzi kalonga, “Haduhu hata imwe, Mndewa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">Yesu kalonga, “Vinoga, hata nie sikutagusa. Genda na zako ila sambiutende vilozo kabili.”<verse eid="JHN 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Iyo Mulangaza wa Ulumwengu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12"/>Yesu kawalongela wanhu kabili, “Nie iyo mulangaza wa ulumwengu. Munhu yoyose yong'hweleleza kowa na mulangaza ugala ugima na hatembela mdiziza kabisa.”<verse eid="JHN 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13"/>Mafalisayo wamulongela, “Gweye koisindila mwenyego, avo gano gaulonga hagatogoligwa kamba kweli.”<verse eid="JHN 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Hata nihaisindila mwenyego, usindila wangu wotogoligwa kamba kweli, kwavija nikutanga kunilawa na kunichola, ila mweye hamkutangile kunilawa ama kunichola. <verse eid="JHN 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15"/>Mweye motenda nhaguso ya kiunhu, ila nie simtagusa munhu yoyose. <verse eid="JHN 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16"/>Na kamba nihamtagusa munhu, nhaguso yangu ina kweli mgati yake, kwavija nie sili niiyeka muinhaguso ino, ila Tata yanhumile ka hamoja na nie. <verse eid="JHN 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17"/>Yandikigwa Mmalagizo genu kamba usindila wa wanhu wabili wotogoligwa kamba kweli. <verse eid="JHN 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18"/>Niisindila mwenyego, na Tata yanhumile vivija konisindila.”<verse eid="JHN 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19"/>Wamuuza, “Tataako kakwahi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">Yesu kawalongela, “Hamunimanyile nie na Tataangu hamummanyile. Kamba muhanimanyile nie, vivija muhammanyile na Tataangu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20"/>Yesu kagalonga gano gose viyakalile yofundiza Kung'anda ya Mulungu, mdigati dija mkikigwe kia cha kulavila nhosa. Na haduhu munhu yagezile kumgoga, kwavija kipigiti chake cha kugogigwa kikala hakinavika.<verse eid="JHN 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hamdaha Kuchola Kunichola Nie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21"/>Kabili Yesu kawalongela, “Nochola na zangu, ila mokwiza kunizahila, na mofa na vilozo venu. Na hamdaha kuchola kunichola nie.”<verse eid="JHN 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22"/>Avo wakulu wa Wayahudi walonga, “Kalonga kamba hatudaha kuchola koyochola heyo. Konda kuikoma?”<verse eid="JHN 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23"/>Yesu kawedika yolonga, “Mweye mulawa hasi, nie nilawa uchana. Mweye mwa wanhu wa ulumwengu uno, nie si munhu wa ulumwengu uno. <verse eid="JHN 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24"/>Niwalongela kamba mofa na vilozo venu. Kamba hamutogole kamba nie iyo, kweli mofa na vilozo venu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25"/>Wamuuza, “Gweye iyo yalihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">Yesu kawalongela, “Nie iyo ija iniwalongele songela haichanduso. <verse eid="JHN 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26"/>Nna mbuli bwando za kuwalonga mweye, na mbuli bwando za kuwatagusila. Ayo yanhumile kabule uvwizi, na nie noulongela ulumwengu gaja ganihulike kulawa kumwake.”<verse eid="JHN 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27"/>Hawavitangile kamba Yesu kakala yowalongela mbuli za Tata. <verse eid="JHN 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Muhaniinula<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hano </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Kwinula </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hana nhegulo mbili muulonzi wa Kigiliki, nhegulo ya ichanduso </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kuyenzigwa, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">na nhegulo ya ikabili </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kuwambigwa mumsalaba.</char></note> nie, Mwana wa Munhu, movitanga kamba nie iyo, na sitenda kinhu chochose nene mwenyego, ila nolonga mbuli zino kamba viyanilongele Tata. <verse eid="JHN 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29"/>Na ayo yanhumile nie ka hamoja na nie, hanilekile niiyeka, kwavija mazua gose notenda gaja gamnogele heyo.”<verse eid="JHN 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30"/>Viyakalile yolonga mbuli zino, wanhu bwando wamtogola.<verse eid="JHN 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kweli Yowatenda Mkale Muulegeho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31"/>Avo Yesu kawalongela awo Wayahudi wamtogole, “Kamba muhagatogola mafundo gangu, mowa wanahina zangu wa ikweli. <verse eid="JHN 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32"/>Moitanga ikweli, na ikweli yowatenda mkale muulegeho.”<verse eid="JHN 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33"/>Wamulongela, “Tweye twa lukolo lwa Ablaham, na hatunakuwa nyakadala wa munhu yoyose. Kotulongelaze tokwiza kuilegeha?”<verse eid="JHN 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Nowalongela ikweli, munhu yoyose yoloza hiyo ka nyakadala wa vilozo. <verse eid="JHN 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35"/>Nyakadala hapetigwa kuwa munhu wa mulango wa munhu yomsang'hanikila milongo yose, ila mwana kopetigwa kuwa wa mulango uja milongo yose. <verse eid="JHN 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36"/>Kamba Mwana yahawakombola, mokomboligwa kwelikweli. <verse eid="JHN 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37"/>Novitanga kamba mweye mwa lukolo lwa Ablaham. Hata avo molonda kunikoma kwavija hamgatogola mafundo gangu. <verse eid="JHN 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38"/>Nowalongela gaja ganyonile ha Tataangu, kamba mweye vumtenda gaja gamuhulike kulawa ha tata zenu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39"/>Wamulongela, “Tweye twa lukolo lwa Ablaham.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">Yesu kawalongela, “Kamba muhawile kweli mwa lukolo lwa Ablaham, muhatendile kamba viyatendile Ablaham. <verse eid="JHN 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40"/>Molonda kunikoma nie, munhu yawalongele kweli iniihulike kulawa ha Mulungu. Ablaham hatendile kinhu kamba kino! <verse eid="JHN 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41"/>Mweye motenda goyotenda tata wenu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">Wamulongela, “Tweye hatuli wana wa ugoni. Mulungu yeiyeka iyo Tata wetu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Kamba Mulungu iyo Tata wenu, muhaninogele, kwavija nilawa ha Mulungu na sambi na hano. Siigalile mwenyego, ila Mulungu iyo yanhumile. <verse eid="JHN 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43"/>Habali hamgategeleza gaja ganilonga? Kwavija hamulonda hata kuzihulika mbuli zangu. <verse eid="JHN 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44"/>Mweye mwa wana wa tata wenu, Mwenembago, na molonda kugawinza gaja goyolonda tata wenu. Songela haichanduso heyo kakala mkoma wanhu na hakalile muikweli hata mwanza umwe, kwavija mmwake mduhu kweli. Yahalonga uvwizi, kumwake heyo kotenda goya, kwavija heyo m'vwizi na iyo tata wa wavwizi wose. <verse eid="JHN 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45"/>Ila kwavija nie nowalongela ikweli, hamunitogola. <verse eid="JHN 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46"/>Yalihi mmwanza wenu yodaha kunongela nie kamba nna vilozo? Na kamba nowalongela ikweli, habali basi hamunitogola? <verse eid="JHN 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47"/>Munhu yalawile ha Mulungu kozitegeleza mbuli za Mulungu. Kwavija mweye hamulawile ha Mulungu, kileka mana hamzitegeleza.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Ablaham</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48"/>Wakulu wa Wayahudi wamwidika, wolonga, “Tuhonyela vitulongile kamba gweye kwa Msamalia na kuna kinyamkela?”<verse eid="JHN 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49"/>Yesu kawedika, yolonga, “Nie nabule kinyamkela. Nie nomuhishimila Tataangu, ila mweye monizabuza nie. <verse eid="JHN 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50"/>Nie sizahila yenzi yangu mwenyego. Ila kuna imwe yoizahila, na heyo iyo mulamula. <verse eid="JHN 8:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51"/>Nowalongela ikweli, munhu yoyose yogatogola mafundo gangu hadanganhika.”<verse eid="JHN 8:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52"/>Wakulu wa Wayahudi wamulongela, “Sambisambi tuvimanya kamba kuna kinyamkela! Ablaham kadanganhika na wahokozi wayagwe wadanganhika, hata avo gweye ung'hali longa kamba munhu yoyose yogatogola mafundo gako hadanganhika. <verse eid="JHN 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53"/>Muhenga wetu Ablaham kadanganhika na wahokozi wayagwe vivija wadanganhika. Gweye koitenda mkulu kubanza muhenga wetu Ablaham? Vuigelegeza gweye kwa munhu yalihi hasa?”<verse eid="JHN 8:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Kamba nihaitogola mwenyego, nhogolwa yangu si kinhu. Yonitogola nie iyo Tataangu, ayo yummulonga kamba iyo Mulungu wenu. <verse eid="JHN 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55"/>Mweye hamumtangile, ila nie nimtanga. Kamba nihalonga simtangile, nowa m'vwizi kamba mweye. Ila nie nimtanga na nozigoga mbuli zake. <verse eid="JHN 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56"/>Muhenga wenu Ablaham kadeng'helela viyalolile haulongozi na kuwona mwizilo wangu. Kawona na kadeng'helela ng'hani.”<verse eid="JHN 8:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57"/>Wayahudi wamulongela, “Gweye hunavikila hata milao malongo matano, kumona Ablaham?”<verse eid="JHN 8:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Nowalongela ikweli, kipigiti Ablaham hanavumbuka, ‘Nie iyo.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 8:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59"/>Viyalongile vija, wadondola mabwe giladi wamtoe, ila Yesu kaifisa, abaho, kalawa Kung'anda ya Mulungu.<verse eid="JHN 8:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Komuhonya Munhu Yavumbuke Kimbugumbugu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1"/>Yesu viyakalile yobita mnzila, kamona munhu yavumbuke kimbugumbugu. <verse eid="JHN 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2"/>Wanahina zake wamuuza, “Mkulufunzi, yalihi yalozile, kileka mana munhu ino yavumbuke kimbugumbugu, heyo mwenyego ama wamulelile?”<verse eid="JHN 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Sio munhu ino ama waja wamulelile watendile vilozo, gano galawilila giladi sang'hano za Mulungu zoneke mkubitila heyo. <verse eid="JHN 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4"/>Kipigiti chose cha imisi tolondigwa kutenda sang'hano za ayo yanhumile. Kilo chokwiza haduhu munhu yondayadahe kusang'hanika. <verse eid="JHN 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5"/>Kipigiti nie ning'hali muulumwengu, nie iyo mulangaza wa ulumwengu.”<verse eid="JHN 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6"/>Viyeshile kulonga gano, Yesu kazenha vizite hasi muisi, abaho, katenda tope yovulugiza na ivizite, abaho, kam'baka mmeso ga ija imunhu.<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus healing blind man mud on eyes" file="JesusHealingBlindMan_John9.1-7_1MudOnEyes_WA03865.jpg" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="9:6">Yesu komuhonya munhu yavumbuke kimbugumbugu.</figure> <verse eid="JHN 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7"/>Kamulongela, “Genda ukainave kihanga chako Mdibwawa da Siloamu.” Nhegulo ya twaga dino iyo, “Yatumigwe.” Avo ija imunhu kachola kaisuluza, kabwela yolola.<verse eid="JHN 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8"/>Wanhu wakalile wokala behi nayo na wanhu wamonile viyakalile yopula kipigiti hanahonyigwa wakiiuza, “Ino hali munhu ija yakalile yokala mnzila yopula?” <verse eid="JHN 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9"/>Wanhu wayagwe walonga, “Iyo heyo,” ila wayagwe walonga, “Sio heyo, ila wailinga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Avo ija imunhu kamana kulonga mwenyego, “Iyo nene.”<verse eid="JHN 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10"/>Wamuuza, “Kutendaze, kileka mana sambi ulola?”<verse eid="JHN 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11"/>Kawalongela, “Munhu imwe yokemigwa Yesu katenda vitope, kanibaka mmeso gangu, kanilongela nichole Siloamu nikaisuluze kihanga changu. Avo nichola, vunimambukize kuisuluza, nilola.”<verse eid="JHN 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12"/>Wamuuza, “Kakwahi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">Kawalongela, “Mmane.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mafalisayo Wouzagiza Uhonya wa Kimbugumbugu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13"/>Abaho, wamsola ija imunhu yakalile kimbugumbugu, wamgala kuwali Mafalisayo. <verse eid="JHN 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14"/>Zua dija Yesu diyatendile ditope na kumuhonya umbugumbugu wake ija imunhu dikala Zua da Mhumulo. <verse eid="JHN 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15"/>Avo Mafalisayo wamuuza ija imunhu kabili vija viyadahile kulola. Kawalongela, “Kanibaka mitope mmeso gangu, abaho, niisuluza kihanga changu, na sambi nolola.”<verse eid="JHN 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16"/>Mafalisayo wayagwe walonga, “Munhu yatendile vino halawile ha Mulungu, kwavija hadigoga Zua da Mhumulo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Wayagwe walonga, “Kodahaze munhu yali na vilozo kutenda mizonza kamba ino?” Avo kukala na muhasanyo wenyego kwa wenyego.<verse eid="JHN 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17"/>Avo Mafalisayo wamuuza ija imunhu mwanza uyagwe, wolonga, “Kulonga kakuhonya umbugumbugu uukalile nao, avo gweye komulonga vilihi munhu ino?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Ija imunhu kalonga, “Nokona munhu ino muhokozi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18"/>Wakulu wa Wayahudi hata avo hawalondile kutogola kamba kakala kimbugumbugu na sambi kolola, mbaka wawakema waja wamulelile, <verse eid="JHN 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19"/>na kuwauza, “Ino iyo mwanenu yummulonga kamba kavumbuka kimbugumbugu? Choni kitendeke mbaka sambi kodaha kulola?”<verse eid="JHN 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20"/>Waja wamulelile wawalongela, “Tuvitanga kamba ino iyo mwanetu, na kakala yavumbuke kimbugumbugu. <verse eid="JHN 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21"/>Ila hatukitangile kija kitendeke mbaka sambi kodaha kulola, vivija hatumtangile yamuhonyile umbugumbugu uyakalile nao. Muuzeni, kwavija heyo mwenyego mkulu, heyo mwenyego kodaha kuwalongela!” <verse eid="JHN 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22"/>Waja wamulelile walonga vino kwavija wakala wowadumba wakulu wa Wayahudi kwavija wakala walamule kamba munhu yoyose yamtogola Yesu kamba iyo Kilisto kowingigwa mng'anda ya nhambiko. <verse eid="JHN 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23"/>Kino kicho kilamso kiwatendile waja wamulelile walonge, “Heyo mwenyego mkulu, muuzeni!”<verse eid="JHN 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24"/>Mwanza wa ikabili wamkema ija imunhu yavumbuke kimbugumbugu, wamulongela, “Mulungu iyo yolondigwa kugweleligwa yenzi mmbuli ino, kwavija tweye tuvitanga kamba munhu ino kana vilozo.”<verse eid="JHN 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25"/>Ija imunhu kawalongela, “Nie sivitanga kamba kana vilozo ama kabule. Kinhu kimwe kinikitanga, nikala kimbugumbugu, na sambi nolola.”<verse eid="JHN 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26"/>Wamuuza, “Kakutendela kinhu chaki? Kakuhonyaze umbugumbugu uukalile nao?”<verse eid="JHN 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27"/>Kawedika, “Niwalongela nisha, na hamtegeleze. Habali mulonda kuhulika kabili? Na mweye molonda kuwa wanahina zake?”<verse eid="JHN 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28"/>Wamuliga, abaho, wamulongela, “Gweye iyo mwanahina wake munhu ija, ila tweye twa wanahina wa Musa. <verse eid="JHN 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29"/>Tukitangile tweye Mulungu kalonga na Musa, ila munhu ino hatukutangile hata koyolawa!”<verse eid="JHN 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30"/>Ija imunhu kawalongela, “Kino kicho kinhu cha mkanganyo! Hamumtangile koyolawa, ila nie kamhonya umbugumbugu unikalile nao! <verse eid="JHN 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31"/>Tuvimanya kamba Mulungu hawategeleza wanhu wali na vilozo, ila kowategeleza wanhu waja womuhulika na kutenda gaja goyolonda heyo wagatende. <verse eid="JHN 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32"/>Songela vuulumbigwe ulumwengu, haduhu munhu yoyose yamuhulike munhu yoyose yamtendile munhu yavumbuke kimbugumbugu yalole. <verse eid="JHN 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33"/>Kamba munhu ino halawile ha Mulungu, sambiyadahe kutenda kinhu chochose.”<verse eid="JHN 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34"/>Wamwidika wolonga, “Gweye kuvumbuka na kukula m'vilozo, abaho, konda kutufundiza tweye?” Avo wamuwinga kulawa mng'anda ya nhambiko.<verse eid="JHN 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Umbugumbugu wa Muloho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35"/>Yesu viyagahulike gaja galawilile, kamzahila ija imunhu, viyamuwene kamulongela, “Gweye komtogola Mwana wa Munhu?”<verse eid="JHN 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36"/>Ija munhu kalonga, “Mndewa, nongela, iyo yalihi giladi nimtogole!”<verse eid="JHN 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Kumona kwisha, na ayo yolonga nagwe iyo heyo.”<verse eid="JHN 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38"/>Ija imunhu kalonga, “Notogola, Mndewa,” abaho, kafugama mavindi kamtambikila.<verse eid="JHN 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39"/>Yesu kalonga, “Niza muulumwengu uno kutagusa, avo vimbugumbugu weze kulola, na awo wolola weze kuwa vimbugumbugu.”<verse eid="JHN 9:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40"/>Mafalisayo wakalile na heyo haja wamuhulika yolonga gano, wamuuza, “Gweye kolonga tweye twa vimbugumbugu?”<verse eid="JHN 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Kamba muhawile vimbugumbugu, sambimuwe na vilozo. Ila kwavija mokiiyona molola, vilozo venu mogendelela kuwa navo.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Hala da Mchunga na Ng'hondolo Zake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1"/>Yesu kalonga, “Nowalongela ikweli, munhu yolema kwingila mulwigo lwa ng'hondolo mkubitila mulwivi, ila kozumha mkiwambaza, munhu hiyo m'bavi na m'bokonyi. <verse eid="JHN 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2"/>Munhu yokwingila mkubitila mulwivi iyo mchunga wa ng'hondolo. <verse eid="JHN 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3"/>Mwimilizi wa ulwivi kom'vugulila, na ng'hondolo wodihulika dizwi jake. Kowakema ng'hondolo zake na matwaga gao, na kuwalava hanze. <verse eid="JHN 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4"/>Yahamala kuwalava hanze, kolongola haulongozi wao, na iwang'hondolo womkweleleza kwavija waditanga dizwi jake. <verse eid="JHN 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5"/>Muhenza hawamkweleleza ila womkimbila, kwavija hawaditangile dizwi jake.”<verse eid="JHN 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6"/>Yesu kawalongela hala dino, ila hawaitangile nhegulo yake.<verse eid="JHN 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Mchunga Yanogile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7"/>Avo Yesu kalonga kabili, “Nowalongela ikweli, nie iyo ulwivi lwa ng'hondolo. <verse eid="JHN 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8"/>Awo wayagwe wose wanilongole wabavi na mibokonyi, ila ng'hondolo hawawahulike. <verse eid="JHN 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9"/>Nie iyo ulwivi. Munhu yoyose yondayengile mkubitila nie kokomboligwa. Kokwingila na kulawa kuchola kuzahila mandia. <verse eid="JHN 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10"/>M'bavi kokwiza giladi yebe na kukoma na kubananga. Nie niza giladi muwe na ugima, na muwe nao bwando.”<verse eid="JHN 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11"/>“Nie iyo mchunga yanogile. Mchunga yanogile koulava ugima wake sama ya ng'hondolo. <verse eid="JHN 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12"/>Munhu wa kitumetume ayo yali sio mchunga, na ng'hondolo sio zake. Yahamona mbwizi yokwiza, kowaleka iwang'hondolo na kukimbila. Avo mbwizi kowagoga iwang'hondolo na wayagwe wopwililika. <verse eid="JHN 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13"/>Munhu wa kitumetume kokimbila kwavija munhu wa kitumetume hawagelegeza ng'hondolo, kwavija si ng'hondolo zake. <verse eid="JHN 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14"/>Nie iyo mchunga yanogile. Nowatanga ng'hondolo zangu na hewo wonitanga, <verse eid="JHN 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15"/>kamba vija Tataangu viyonitanga nie na nie vinimtanga Tataangu. Noulava ugima wangu sama ya ng'hondolo. <verse eid="JHN 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16"/>Hana ng'hondolo zangu wayagwe hawali mdikonhi dino. Vivija nolondigwa niwengize, woihulika nongelo yangu na kugaluka dale dimwe na mchunga imwe.<verse eid="JHN 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17"/>“Tata kaninogela nie kwavija noulava ugima wangu, giladi niubokele kabili. <verse eid="JHN 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18"/>Haduhu munhu yonisegezela ugima wangu. Noulava nene mwenyego. Nodaha kuulava na nodaha kuubweza kabili. Vino vivo Tataangu vayanilagize nitende.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19"/>Wayahudi wakiigola kabili sama ya mbuli zino. <verse eid="JHN 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20"/>Wayahudi bwando walonga, “Kana kinyamkela, na kana luwege! Habali mumtegeleza?”<verse eid="JHN 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21"/>Ila wayagwe walonga, “Munhu yali na kinyamkela hadaha kulonga kamba vino! Kodahaze kinyamkela kuwatenda wanhu vimbugumbugu walole?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kolemigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22"/>Ukala msimu wa kihuhe, na Lusona lwa Kuifumbika Ng'anda ya Mulungu Mmakono ga Mulungu lukala lugendelela ako Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23"/>Yesu kakala yobita hanhu hokemigwa Lubuga lwa Selemani muja mgati ya idikonhi da Ing'anda ya Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24"/>Wakulu wa Wayahudi wammemela wamzunguluka, abaho, wamuuza, “Kotululunganya mbaka zua dilihi? Tulongele ikweli kamba gweye iyo Kilisto!”<verse eid="JHN 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Niwalongela nisha, ila hamulondile kutogola. Mbuli zinitenda mtwaga da Tataangu zolonga vinili nie. <verse eid="JHN 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26"/>Ila hamunitogola kwavija mweye hamuli ng'hondolo zangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27"/>Ng'hondolo zangu wodihulika dizwi jangu. Nowatanga, na wonikweleleza nie. <verse eid="JHN 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28"/>Nowagwelela ugima wa digunge, na hawadanganhika, na haduhu munhu yondayadahe kuwabokonya kulawa kumwangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29"/>Tataangu, yangwelele wano, iyo mkulu kubanza vinhu vose. Haduhu munhu yondayadahe kuwabokonya kulawa mmakono gake Tata. <verse eid="JHN 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30"/>Tata na nie twa kinhu kimwe.”<verse eid="JHN 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31"/>Abaho, Wayahudi wenula mabwe kabili wamtoe nago. <verse eid="JHN 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Niwalagusila mizonza bwando mikulu kulawa ha Tataangu, mbuli ilihi ihile yumulondela kunitoela na mabwe?”<verse eid="JHN 10:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33"/>Wamulongela, “Hatulonda kukutoa gweye na mabwe sama ya mbuli zinogile, ila sama ya ufukuzi wako! Gweye kwa munhu, abaho, kokiitenda mwenyego kuwa Mulungu!”<verse eid="JHN 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34"/>Yesu kawedika kalonga, “Hayandikigwe Mmalagizo genu, ‘Nilonga, mweye mwa miungu’? <verse eid="JHN 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35"/>Kamba Mulungu kawakema ‘miungu’ awo wavikiligwe na usenga wake, na Nyandiko Zing'alile hazidahika kubezigwa, <verse eid="JHN 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36"/>kamba nie Tata kanisagula na kunhuma muulumwengu, vilihi mweye molonga nofukula kwavija nilonga nie iyo Mwana wa Mulungu? <verse eid="JHN 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37"/>Kamba sitendile sang'hano zoyonilonda nitende Tataangu, sambimunitogole. <verse eid="JHN 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38"/>Ila kamba nihazitenda, hata kamba hamunitogola, mogatogola gaja gondanitende, giladi m'vitange kamba Tata ka mgati yangu, na nie na mgati ya Tataangu.”<verse eid="JHN 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39"/>Walonda kumgoga mwanza uyagwe kabili, ila kawazuluhuka mmakono gao.<verse eid="JHN 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40"/>Abaho, Yesu kabweleganya mwambu wa ikabili wa Ulwanda lwa Yolodani kachola hanhu haja hayakalile yobatiza Yohana umwaka, kakala haja. <verse eid="JHN 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41"/>Wanhu bwando wamcholela, walonga, “Yohana hatendile mzonza wowose, ila mbuli zose zayamulongile munhu ino zilawila kweli.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42"/>Avo wanhu bwando haja wamtogola Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Lazalo Kodanganhika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1"/>Munhu imwe yokemigwa Lazalo, yakalile yokala Betania, kakala yolumwa. Betania kikala kiwambo chawakalile wokala Mata na lumbu jake Maliamu. <verse eid="JHN 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2"/>Maliamu ino iyo yamwitile mavuta ga kunung'hila Mndewa mmagulu na kumuhangusa na mvili zake. Lazalo yakalile yolumwa kakala lumbu jake. <verse eid="JHN 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3"/>Walumbu wano wamgalila usenga Mndewa, wolonga, “Mndewa, mbwigaako yuumnogele kolumwa.” <verse eid="JHN 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4"/>Yesu viyahulike, kalonga, “Kimambukizo cha malawililo ga utamu uno hakigala ifa ya Lazalo, ila ulawila giladi Mulungu yayenzigwe. Na mkilamso kino, Mwana wa Mulungu koyenzigwa.”<verse eid="JHN 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5"/>Yesu kakala yamnogele Mata na lumbu jake na Lazalo. <verse eid="JHN 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6"/>Viyahulike kamba Lazalo kolumwa, kakala bahaja hayakalile mazua mabili. <verse eid="JHN 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7"/>Abaho, kawalongela wanahina zake, “Tubweleganye Yudea.” <verse eid="JHN 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8"/>Wanahina zake wamulongela, “Mkulufunzi, kipigiti kiguhi kibitile Wayahudi wa kuja walonda kukutoa na mabwe, abaho, konda kubweleganya kukuja?”<verse eid="JHN 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9"/>Yesu kalonga, “Zua hadili na masaa longo dimwe na mabili? Avo munhu yoyose yotembela imisi hadaha kuikwala, kwavija kowona mulangaza wa ulumwengu. <verse eid="JHN 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10"/>Ila yahatembela ikilo kokiikwala, kwavija kabule mulangaza.” <verse eid="JHN 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11"/>Viyamambukize kulonga gano, kawalongela, “Mbwiga wetu Lazalo kawasa, ila nochola nikamulamuse.”<verse eid="JHN 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12"/>Wanahina zake wamulongela, “Mndewa, kamba kawasa, basi kohona.”<verse eid="JHN 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13"/>Yesu kakala yalongile ifa ya Lazalo, ila wanahina zake wagiza kawasa utulo wa mazua gose. <verse eid="JHN 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14"/>Avo Yesu kawalongela bila kufisa, “Lazalo kadanganhika, <verse eid="JHN 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15"/>ila sama yenu mweye, nie ninogelwa ng'hani kwavija sikalile kuja, giladi mtogole. Tucholeni kumwake.”<verse eid="JHN 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16"/>Tomaso, yokemigwa Ubasa, kawalongela wanahina wayage, “Tucholeni hamoja na Mkulufunzi, avo yahakomigwa tukomigwe tose!”<verse eid="JHN 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Iyo Mzuso na Ugima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17"/>Yesu viyavikile, kavika Lazalo yazikigwe mazua mane gabitile. <verse eid="JHN 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18"/>Betania kikala kiwambo kikalile behi na Yelusalemu, kamba mwanza wa kilometa ndatu, <verse eid="JHN 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19"/>na Wayahudi bwando weza kumulola Mata na Maliamu kuwahani avija lumbu jao viyadanganhike.<verse eid="JHN 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20"/>Mata viyahulike kamba Yesu kokwiza, kalawa hanze yam'bokele, ila Maliamu kasigala mng'anda. <verse eid="JHN 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21"/>Mata kamulongela Yesu, “Mndewa, kamba uhakalile baha, lumbu jangu sambiyadanganhike. <verse eid="JHN 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22"/>Ila nivitanga kamba hata lelo Mulungu kokugwelela chochose chondaumpule.”<verse eid="JHN 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Lumbu jako kozuka.”<verse eid="JHN 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24"/>Kamwidika, kalonga, “Nivitanga kamba kozuka mdizua da ikimambukizo.”<verse eid="JHN 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Nie iyo mzuso na ugima. Awo wonitogola, hata kamba wahadanganhika, wowa wagima kabili. <verse eid="JHN 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26"/>Na awo wose wali na ugima na kunitogola nie hawadanganhika. Kozitogola mbuli zino?”<verse eid="JHN 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27"/>Kamulongela, “Ona, Mndewa, notogola kamba gweye iyo Kilisto, Mwana wa Mulungu, ayo yokwiza muulumwengu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kolila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28"/>Mata viyeshile kulonga gano, kabweleganya mng'anda kachola kumkema lumbu jake Maliamu, kamnyong'onyela, “Mkulufunzi kabaha avo kokulonda.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29"/>Maliamu viyahulike gano, kenuka hima kalawa hanze kachola ha Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30"/>Yesu kakala hanavika hakiwambo, ila kakala haja hawaiting'hane na Mata. <verse eid="JHN 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31"/>Wayahudi wakalile na Maliamu mng'anda womuhembekeza, viwamonile yogundumuka yolawa hanze, wamkweleleza. Wagiza kakala yochola kudipanga kulila.<verse eid="JHN 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32"/>Maliamu viyavikile haja hayakalile Yesu, viyamonile, kagwa ha magulu gake, kalonga, “Mndewa, kamba uhakalile baha, lumbu jangu sambiyadanganhike!”<verse eid="JHN 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33"/>Yesu kamulola viyakalile yolila, abaho, kawalola waja wanhu wakalile na heyo vivija viwakalile wolila, kagaya ng'hani mmoyo na kona chuhila ng'hani. <verse eid="JHN 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34"/>Kawauza, “Mumzikila kwahi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:34">Wamulongela, “Izo ulole, Mndewa.”<verse eid="JHN 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35"/>Yesu kalila. <verse eid="JHN 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36"/>Wayahudi walonga, “Loleni viyamnogele!”<verse eid="JHN 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37"/>Ila wanhu wayagwe walonga, “Ayo yamtendile munhu kimbugumbugu yalole, hadahile kumtenda Lazalo sambiyadanganhike?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lazalo Kozusigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38"/>Yesu kona chuhila ng'hani mwanza wa ikabili, kachola kudipanga. Dikala kamba mhango, na dibwe kulu dikigwa hamulomo. <verse eid="JHN 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39"/>Yesu kalonga, “Segezeni didibwe!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">Mata, lumbu ja ija imunhu yadanganhike, kamulongela, “Mndewa, kuna bundo, kwavija kazikigwa mazua mane gabitile!”<verse eid="JHN 11:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Sikulongele kamba uhatogola, koyona yenzi ya Mulungu?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41"/>Wadisegeza didibwe. Yesu kalola uchana, kalonga, “Nokuheweza, Tata, kwavija konhegeleza nie. <verse eid="JHN 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42"/>Nivitanga kamba mazua gose konhegeleza, ila nolonga gano sama ya wanhu wali hano, giladi kwiza watogole kamba gweye iyo unhumile.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43"/>Viyeshile kulonga gano, kenula dizwi yolonga, “Lazalo, lawa hanze!” <verse eid="JHN 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44"/>Ija imunhu yakalile yadanganhike kalawa hanze, kuno makono gake na magulu gake gazingilizwe na sanda, na kihanga chake kizingilizwa kitambala. Yesu kawalongela, “Mfunguleni, mmuleke yachole na zake.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Zundo da Kumkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat. 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mlk. 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk. 22:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45"/>Wayahudi bwando wezile kumulola Maliamu wagona gaja gayatendile Yesu, na wamtogola. <verse eid="JHN 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46"/>Ila wayagwe mmwanza wao wachola ha Mafalisayo na kuwalongela gaja Yesu gayatendile. <verse eid="JHN 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47"/>Avo Mafalisayo na wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko waiting'hana na Ikitala Kikulu cha Isi ya Wayahudi, walonga, “Tutendeze? Loleni mizonza yose yootenda munhu ino. <verse eid="JHN 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48"/>Kamba tuhamuleka yagendelele kamba vino, wanhu wose womtogola, na Wakulu wa Loma wokwinuka na kuibananga isi yetu na Ing'anda ya Mulungu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49"/>Imwe mmwanza wao, yokemigwa Kayafa, yakalile Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko mulao uja, kalonga, “Mweye mwa mipulaputi kabisa. <verse eid="JHN 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50"/>Ham'vitangile kamba vinoga munhu imwe yadanganhike sama ya wanhu bwando, kubanza kuileka isi yose ibanangike?” <verse eid="JHN 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51"/>Halongile gano kulawa mmoyo wake mwenyego, ila avija viyakalile Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko mulao uja, kakala yalongozwe na Mulungu yahokole kamba Yesu kodanganhika sama ya Wayahudi wose, <verse eid="JHN 11:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52"/>na sio hewo weiyeka, ila vivija kaweka hamoja kamba lukuli lumwe wana wa Mulungu wapwililike.<verse eid="JHN 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53"/>Songela zua dija wakulu wa Wayahudi weka mizundo ya kumkoma Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54"/>Avo Yesu kakala yotembela mkuifisa muiisi ya Yudea, na kasegela kachola hana ikiwambo kikemigwa Eflaim, kikalile behi na luwala, kakala haja na wanahina zake.<verse eid="JHN 11:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55"/>Lusona lwa Pasaka lwa Wayahudi lukala behi, na wanhu bwando walawa muisi zao wachola Yelusalemu kutaulwa kipigiti lusona halunasonga. <verse eid="JHN 11:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56"/>Wakala womzahila Yesu, na viwakalile wemile Kung'anda ya Mulungu, waiuza, “Mogelegeza vilihi? Heza hana ulusona, ama vilihi?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57"/>Wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko na Mafalisayo walava ndagizi kamba, munhu yoyose yahakutanga kuyali Yesu kolondigwa yakawalongele, giladi wamgoge.<verse eid="JHN 11:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kobakigwa Mavuta ako Betania</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat. 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mlk. 14:3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1"/>Vigasigale mazua sita kuvikila Pasaka, Yesu kachola Betania hakae ya Lazalo, munhu ija yazusigwe kulawa mkudanganhika. <verse eid="JHN 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2"/>Wamtelekela mandia ga ichungulo, Mata kakala yowataza kugomela. Lazalo kakala imwe wa wanhu wakalile hameza na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3"/>Abaho, Maliamu kasola nyhupa ya mavuta ga kunung'hila ga hela bwando gatendigwe na nado, kamwitila Yesu mmagulu, abaho, kamuhangusa na mvili zake. Mnung'ho unogile wa gamavuta gaja ga kunung'hila wenela mng'anda yose. <verse eid="JHN 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4"/>Mwanahina imwe wa Yesu, yokemigwa Yuda Isikalioti ayo yamuhonzile Yesu, kalonga, <verse eid="JHN 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5"/>“Habali mavuta gano ga kunung'hila sambigaguzigwe zipatikane hela za kuliha kitumetume cha mulao umwe giladi wagweleligwe wakumbulu?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6"/>Kalonga vino si kamba kowonela bazi wakumbulu, ila kwavija kakala m'bavi. Heyo iyo yakalile yopapa umkoba wa izihela na kakala yokwiba kulawa himo.<verse eid="JHN 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7"/>Ila Yesu kalonga, “Mulekeni! Lekeni yageke mavuta higo mbaka zua da mazisi gangu. <verse eid="JHN 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8"/>Wakumbulu munao mazua gose, ila nie sikala namwe mazua gose.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Zundo da Kumkoma Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9"/>Wayahudi bwando wahulika kamba Yesu kakala mkiwambo cha Betania, avo wachola kuja sio tu kumulola Yesu ila vivija kumulola Lazalo, ayo Yesu yamzusile kulawa mkudanganhika. <verse eid="JHN 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10"/>Avo wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko weka zundo da kumkoma Lazalo vivija, <verse eid="JHN 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11"/>kwavija sama ya gaja gatendigwe kumwake, Wayahudi bwando wawalema hewo na kumtogola Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kokwingila Yelusalemu na Wila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat. 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mlk. 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk. 19:28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12"/>Zua da ikabili, wanhu bwando wezile Kulusona lwa Pasaka wahulika kamba Yesu kokwiza Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13"/>Avo wasola mitambi ya mitende walawa wachola kum'bokela, kuno wenula dizwi, wolonga, “Yatogolwe Mulungu! Mulungu mmoteze ayo yokwiza mtwaga da Mndewa! Mulungu mmoteze Mndewa wa Islaeli!”<verse eid="JHN 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14"/>Yesu kam'vika mwana mhunda, na kukwela uchana yake, kamba Nyandiko Zing'alile vuzilonga,<verse eid="JHN 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15"/>“Sambiudumbe, gweye kiwambo cha Sayuni!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">Mndewa wako kokwiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:15">yapapigwe mumgongo wa mhunda mdodo.”<verse eid="JHN 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16"/>Wanahina zake hawagatangile gano kipigiti kija, ila Yesu viyayenzigwe, wakumbukila kamba Nyandiko Zing'alile zilonga gano na avo gatendigwa gano sama yake.<verse eid="JHN 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17"/>Wanhu wakalile na Yesu kipigiti viyamkemile Lazalo kulawa mdipanga na kumzusa kulawa mkudanganhika wagendelela kugapeta gaja galawilile. <verse eid="JHN 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18"/>Wanhu bwando wachola kum'bokela, kwavija wakala wahulike kamba katenda mzonza uno. <verse eid="JHN 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19"/>Abaho, Mafalisayo wakiilongela, “M'vona, tuhumwa! Lola, ulumwengu wose womkweleleza heyo!”<verse eid="JHN 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wagiliki Womzahila Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20"/>Mmwanza wa wanhu waja wacholile Yelusalemu kutambika kipigiti cha Ulusona lwa Pasaka wakala Wagiliki. <verse eid="JHN 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21"/>Wachola ha Filipo, yakalile mwenekae wa Betisaida ako Galilaya, wamulongela, “Mndewa, tolonda kumona Yesu.”<verse eid="JHN 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22"/>Filipo kachola kumulongela Endelea, na awo wabili wachola kumulongela Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Kipigiti cha nie, Mwana wa Munhu, kuyenzigwa kivika. <verse eid="JHN 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24"/>Nowalongela ikweli, kamba nzele ya ngano hailagale hasi na kudanganhika, yosigala kuwa imwe. Ila ihadanganhika, yolela nzele bwando. <verse eid="JHN 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25"/>Awo wounogela ugima wao wowagiza, na awo wowihila ugima wao muulumwengu uno wowika kuugima wa digunge. <verse eid="JHN 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26"/>Munhu yoyose yolonda kunisang'hanikila kolondigwa yang'holeleze nie, kuja kunili na mtumigwa wangu vivija kowa hiko. Tataangu komuhishimila munhu yoyose yonisang'hanikila nie.<verse eid="JHN 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Koilonga Ifa Yake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27"/>“Moyo wangu una giogio, nongeze? Nilonge, ‘Tata, sambiuleke mbuli zino zinivikile?’ Bule, kwavija niza sama ya mbuli zino. <verse eid="JHN 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28"/>Tata, udiyenzi twaga jako!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Abaho, dihulikwa dizwi kulawa kuulanga, “Nidiyenzi, na nodiyenzi kabili.”<verse eid="JHN 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29"/>Wanhu bwando wakalile haja wadihulika dizwi dija, na wanhu wayagwe walonga ukala mdumo. Wayagwe walonga, “Msenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga kalonga nayo!”<verse eid="JHN 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30"/>Ila Yesu kawalongela, “Dizwi dino dihulikwe si sama yangu nie, ila sama yenu mweye. <verse eid="JHN 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31"/>Kino hicho kipigiti cha kutaguswa kwa ulumwengu, na kipigiti kino mtawala wa ulumwengu uno kowingigwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32"/>Nihenuligwa uchana kulawa muisi, nomkwega kila munhu kumwangu.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33"/>Mkulonga gano kalagusa ifa ilihi yondayadanganhikile.<verse eid="JHN 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34"/>Adija ididale da wanhu dimulongela, “Malagizo getu gotulongela kamba Kilisto kokala milongo yose. Avo gweye kolongaze kamba Mwana wa Munhu kolondigwa yenuligwe uchana? Mwana ino wa Munhu iyo yalihi?”<verse eid="JHN 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mulangaza wowa namwe mkipigiti kidodo. Gendeleleni kutembela mnzila imulinayo kipigiti mulangaza ung'hali namwe, giladi ziza sambidiwavike. Kwavija munhu yotembela mziza hakutanga koyochola. <verse eid="JHN 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36"/>Utogoleni mulangaza kipigiti u hamoja namwe, giladi muwe wana wa mulangaza.”</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 12:36">Wanhu Walibule Nhogola</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Yesu viyeshile kulonga gano, kasegela kachola kuifisa. <verse eid="JHN 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37"/>Hamoja na kutenda mizonza ino yose hameso gao, hawamtogole, <verse eid="JHN 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38"/>avo gaja gayalongile Muhokozi Isaya galawilila kweli, yolonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">“Mndewa, yalihi yautogole usenga wetu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">Mhiko ya Mndewa igubuligwa ha munhu yalihi?”<verse eid="JHN 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39"/>Hawatogole, kwavija vivija Isaya kalonga,<verse eid="JHN 12:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40"/>“Mulungu kagagubika meso gao,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">na kuzibumbuwaza nzewele zao,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">avo meso gao sambigalole,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">na sambiwavitange mnzewele zao,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">giladi sambiwanihindukile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">niwahonye.”<verse eid="JHN 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41"/>Isaya kagalonga gano kwavija kayona yenzi ya Yesu na kumulonga heyo.<verse eid="JHN 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42"/>Avo wanhu bwando mmwanza wa wakulu wa Wayahudi wamtogola. Ila sama ya kuwadumba Mafalisayo hawamtogole hakimwagaia, kwavija wadumba sambiwawawinge kulawa mng'anda ya nhambiko. <verse eid="JHN 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43"/>Wanogelwa na nhogolwa za wanhu kubanza nhogolwa za Mulungu.<verse eid="JHN 12:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuli za Yesu Zowatagusa Wanhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44"/>Yesu kenula dizwi kalonga, “Munhu yoyose yonitogola nie hanitogola nie niiyeka, ila vivija komtogola ayo yanhumile. <verse eid="JHN 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45"/>Munhu yoyose yonyona nie vivija komona ayo yanhumile. <verse eid="JHN 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46"/>Nie niza muulumwengu kamba mulangaza, avo munhu yoyose yonitogola sambiyasigale mdiziza. <verse eid="JHN 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47"/>Kamba munhu yoyose yahahulika usenga wangu na kuuleka baho, simtagusa. Kwavija nie sizile kuutagusa ulumwengu ila kuukombola. <verse eid="JHN 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48"/>Kwavija awo wonilema nie na kuulema usenga wangu, kabaho yondayawataguse. Mbuli zinilongile zowa mulamula hana idizua da ikimambukizo. <verse eid="JHN 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49"/>Kwavija silongile kamba vinilondile nie mwenyego, ila Tata yanhumile iyo yandagize gaja ga kulonga na vija vondanigalonge. <verse eid="JHN 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50"/>Na nivitanga kamba ndagizi zake zogala ugima wa digunge. Avo kinilonga nie kicho Tata chayanongele nilonge.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kowanava Magulu Wanahina Zake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1"/>Ikala behi na Lusona lwa Pasaka. Yesu kavitanga kamba kipigiti kivika cha heyo kuuleka ulumwengu uno na kuchola ha Tataake. Mazua gose kakala yawanogele awo wakalile wanhu zake muulumwengu, na kawanogela mbaka hakimambukizo cha ugima wake.<verse eid="JHN 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2"/>Yesu na wanahina zake wakala woja mandia ga ichungulo. Mwenembago kakala yeshile kwika mmoyo wa Yuda, mwana wa Simoni Isikalioti, ngelegeza za kumuhonza Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3"/>Yesu kavitanga kamba Tata kamgwaa vinhu vose, na kamba keza kulawa ha Mulungu na kakala yochola ha Mulungu, <verse eid="JHN 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4"/>avo kenuka kulawa haja hameza, kasegeza kitambi chake cha kuigubika mmaega, kaifunga na kitambala mkigudi chake. <verse eid="JHN 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5"/>Abaho, kagela mazi mkiteleko, kasonga kuwanava magulu ga wanahina zake na kuwahangusa na ikitambala kikalile mkigudi chake. <verse eid="JHN 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6"/>Keza ha Simoni Petulo, Simoni Petulo kamulongela, “Mndewa, gweye konda kuganava magulu gangu?”<verse eid="JHN 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7"/>Yesu kamwidika, kalonga, “Kinitenda nie hukimanya sambi baha, ila kokimanya kumwande.”<verse eid="JHN 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8"/>Petulo kamulongela, “Bule, gweye huninava nie magulu gangu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">Yesu kamwidika, kalonga, “Kamba sikunavile gweye, hauli hamoja na nie.”<verse eid="JHN 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9"/>Simoni Petulo kamwidika, kalonga, “Mndewa, sio magulu gangu geiyeka, vivija ninave na makono na pala jangu!”<verse eid="JHN 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10"/>Yesu kalonga, “Munhu yogile kang'ala lukuli lose, ila magulu gake gago golondigwa kunavigwa. Mweye mung'ala, ila si mose.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11"/>Yesu kakala yammanyile munhu yalihi yondayamuhonze, kileka mana yalongile, “Si mose mung'alile.”<verse eid="JHN 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12"/>Yesu viyamambukize kuwanava magulu gao, kaigubika kabili kitambi chake, abaho, kabwela haja hameza hayakalile, abaho, kawauza, “Mkimanya kija kiniwatendele sambisambi? <verse eid="JHN 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13"/>Monikema nie Mkulufunzi na Mndewa, motenda goya, kwavija avo vivo nili. <verse eid="JHN 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14"/>Kamba nie na Mndewa wenu na Mkulufunzi wenu niwanava magulu genu, vivija na mweye molondigwa mkiinave magulu mwemwe kwa mwemwe. <verse eid="JHN 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15"/>Niwalagusila vija vondamtende, avo kwiza mtende kamba vija nie viniwatendele mweye. <verse eid="JHN 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16"/>Nowalongela ikweli, nyakadala hali mkulu kum'banza mndewa wake, na mtumigwa hali mkulu kum'banza ija yamtumile. <verse eid="JHN 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17"/>Sambi mzitanga mbuli zino, momota ng'hani kamba muhazisang'hana.<verse eid="JHN 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18"/>“Siwalonga mweye mose, niwatanga awo iniwasagule. Ila Nyandiko Zing'alile zilonga, ‘Munhu yadile mandia gangu kagaluka kuwa mdumuka wangu,’ zivikile. <verse eid="JHN 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19"/>Nowalongela gano sambisambi kipigiti haganalawila, avo vondagalawile motogola kamba, ‘Nie iyo heyo yokwiza.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20"/>Nowalongela ikweli, munhu yoyose yom'bokela munhu yoyose inimtumile konibokela nie, na munhu yoyose yonibokela nie kom'bokela ayo yanhumile nie.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kohokola Vija Vondayahonzigwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Mat. 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Mlk. 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luk. 22:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21"/>Yesu viyeshile kulonga gano, kona giogio ng'hani mmoyo wake, kalonga, “Nowalongela ikweli, munhu imwe mmwanza wenu konihonza.”<verse eid="JHN 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22"/>Waja iwanahina wakiilola, wakanganya ng'hani wogelegeza yalihi Yesu iyamulongile. <verse eid="JHN 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23"/>Mwanahina imwe, ayo Yesu yaamnogele ng'hani, kakala yakalile behi na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24"/>Simoni Petulo kamfunyiza yomulongela, “Muuze, yalihi yoomulonga mdidale jetu?”<verse eid="JHN 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25"/>Avo ija imwanahina kuno yomsagamila Yesu, kamuuza, “Mndewa, yalihi?”<verse eid="JHN 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26"/>Yesu kalonga, “Ayo yondanimgwelele kidanga kino cha mkate nihesha kukizanhika mkikalango.” Avo kasola ikidanga kakizanhika na kumgwaa Yuda, mwana wa Simoni Isikalioti. <verse eid="JHN 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27"/>Kipigiti kikija Yuda viyasolile ikidanga cha umkate, Mwenembago kamwingila. Yesu kamulongela, “Chuugenda kutenda, kitende mbwisa!” <verse eid="JHN 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28"/>Haduhu munhu yoyose iyagwe haja hameza yavimanyile kamba habali Yesu kamulongela Yuda mbuli zino. <verse eid="JHN 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29"/>Kwavija Yuda kakala iyo mgoga umkoba wa izihela, wanahina wayagwe wagiza Yesu kamulongela yachole kugula vinhu vilondigwa mulusona, ama kuwagwelela kinhu wakumbulu.<verse eid="JHN 13:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30"/>Yuda kakibokela ikidanga cha umkate, abaho, kalawa hanze hima. Na ikala ikilo.<verse eid="JHN 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndagizi ya Isambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31"/>Yuda viyasegele, Yesu kalonga, “Sambisambi nie, Mwana wa Munhu, noyenzigwa, na Mulungu koyenzigwa mkubitila nie. <verse eid="JHN 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32"/>Kamba Mulungu kayenzigwa mkubitila Mwanage, na vivija Mulungu komuyenzi Mwanage mkubitila heyo mwenyego, na kotenda avo hima. <verse eid="JHN 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33"/>Wanangu, sikala namwe kipigiti kitali. Kwiza monizahila, ila nowalongela kamba viniwalongele Wayahudi, sambi vivija nowalongela na mweye, ‘Kunichola nie mweye hamdaha kwiza.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34"/>Na sambisambi nowagwelela ndagizi ya isambi, ‘Muinogele.’ Kamba viniwanogele mweye, avo molondigwa muinogele. <verse eid="JHN 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35"/>Kamba muhainogela, wanhu wose wovitanga kamba mweye mwa wanahina zangu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kohokola Avija Petulo Vondayam'bele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat. 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mlk. 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk. 22:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36"/>Simoni Petulo kamuuza, “Kochola kwahi, Mndewa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">Yesu kamwidika, yolonga, “Hudaha kunikweleleza kunichola nie sambisambi, ila koniwinza mazua ga hamwande.”<verse eid="JHN 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37"/>Petulo kamuuza, “Mndewa, habali sidaha kukukweleleza sambisambi? Nie nhogola kudanganhika sama yako!”<verse eid="JHN 13:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38"/>Yesu kamwidika, yolonga, “Kolonga kweli kamba kutogola kudanganhika sama yangu? Nokulongela ikweli, behi na nzogolo zikwika, konibela mianza midatu kamba hunimanyile.”<verse eid="JHN 13:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Iyo Nzila ya Kuvika ha Tata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Sambimnyunguale mmioyo yenu. Mtogoleni Mulungu, munitogole na nie. <verse eid="JHN 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2"/>Kuna magati bwando mng'anda ya Tataangu, nochola kuwatandila hanhu. Kamba sambiiwe avo, sambiniwalongele mweye gano. <verse eid="JHN 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3"/>Na nihachola kuwatandileni hanhu, nobwela niwasole niwagale kumwangu, avo mowa haja hanili nie. <verse eid="JHN 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4"/>Moitanga nzila ilongoze hanhu kunichola.”<verse eid="JHN 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5"/>Tomaso kamulongela, “Mndewa, hatukutangile kuuchola, avo toitangaze inzila?”<verse eid="JHN 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6"/>Yesu kamwidika, yolonga, “Nie iyo nzila, kweli, na ugima. Haduhu munhu yondayachole ha Tata kamba habitile kumwangu.” <verse eid="JHN 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Avija vumunitanga nie sambisambi, vivija momtanga na Tataangu. Na songela kipigiti kino na kugendelela, mumtanga na mumona.”<verse eid="JHN 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8"/>Filipo kamulongela, “Mndewa, tulagusile Tata, kino kicho kinhu kitulonda.”<verse eid="JHN 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9"/>Yesu kamwidika, yolonga, “Nikala na mweye mkipigiti kino chose, ung'hali hunanitanga, Filipo? Munhu yoyose yanyonile nie kamona Tata. Habali ulonga, ‘Tulagusile Tata’?” <verse eid="JHN 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10"/>Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, “Hamtogola kamba nie na mgati ya Tata na Tata ka mgati yangu? Mbuli ziniwalongele sizilongile na udaho wangu mwenyego. Ila Tata yokala mgati yangu kotenda sang'hano yake. <verse eid="JHN 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11"/>Nihalonga nie na mgati ya Tata, na Tata ka mgati yangu, nitogoleni. Kamba hamulonda kutogola gano, zitogoleni sang'hano zinitenda. <verse eid="JHN 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12"/>Nowalongela ikweli, awo wonitogola nie vivija wozitenda sang'hano zinitenda nie, na wozitenda sang'hano ng'hulu kubanza zino, kwavija nochola ha Tata. <verse eid="JHN 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13"/>Na chochose chondampule mtwaga jangu, nokitenda, avo Tata yayenzigwe kubitila Mwana. <verse eid="JHN 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14"/>Kamba muhanipula kinhu chochose mtwaga jangu, nokitenda.<verse eid="JHN 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kilagano cha Wizilo wa Loho wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15"/>“Kamba muhaninogela nie, mozigoga ndagizi zangu. <verse eid="JHN 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16"/>Nompula Tata, na heyo kowagwelela Ija iyagwe wa Kuwataza, yondayakale na mweye milongo yose. <verse eid="JHN 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17"/>Ino iyo Loho wa ikweli. Ulumwengu haudaha kum'bokela, kwavija haumona ama kumtanga. Ila mweye momtanga, kwavija kokala na mweye na kowa mgati yenu.<verse eid="JHN 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18"/>“Nihachola, siwaleka ukiwa, nowabwelela. <verse eid="JHN 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19"/>Kisigala kipigiti kiguhi ulumwengu haunyona, ila mweye monyona. Kwavija nowa na ugima, na mweye mowa na ugima. <verse eid="JHN 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20"/>Zua dija vondadivike movitanga kamba nie na mgati ya Tata, na mweye mwa mgati yangu, na nie na mgati yenu.<verse eid="JHN 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21"/>“Awo wozitogola ndagizi zangu na kuzigoga, wawo wanogelwe na nie. Na awo woninogela nie wonogelwa na Tataangu, na nie nowanogela na kuigubula kumwao.”<verse eid="JHN 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22"/>Yuda, sio Yuda Isikalioti, kalonga, “Mndewa, vilihi uigubule kumwetu na sio kuulumwengu?”<verse eid="JHN 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Munhu yoyose yoninogela nie kogagoga mafundo gangu. Tataangu komnogela, na nie na Tataangu tokwiza kumwake na kukala na heyo. <verse eid="JHN 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24"/>Munhu yoyose yoleka kuninogela nie hagagoga mafundo gangu. Na mbuli zino zimuhulika sio mbuli zangu nie ila za Tata yanhumile.<verse eid="JHN 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25"/>“Niwalongela gano kipigiti ning'hali na mweye. <verse eid="JHN 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26"/>Ila Ija wa Kuwataza, ayo Loho wa Mulungu, Tata yondayamgale mtwaga jangu, kowafundiza kila kinhu na kuwakumbusa mbuli zose ziniwalongele.<verse eid="JHN 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27"/>“Tindiwalo nowalekela, tindiwalo kulawa kumwangu nowagwelela. Sidilava kamba ulumwengu vuulava. Sambimdumbe ama kudungwadungwa mmioyo yenu. <verse eid="JHN 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28"/>Munihulika nie vunilongile, ‘Nosegela, ila nobwela kumwenu.’ Kamba muhaninogele, muhadeng'helele kwavija nochola ha Tata, kwavija Tata mkulu kubanza nie. <verse eid="JHN 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29"/>Niwalongela gano kipigiti kino mbuli zino hazinalawila, giladi zihalawila, mtogole. <verse eid="JHN 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30"/>Silongelela ng'hani namwe kwavija mtawala wa ulumwengu uno kokwiza. Heyo kabule mhiko za kunihuma nie, <verse eid="JHN 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31"/>ila ulumwengu wolondigwa uvitange kamba nomnogela Tata. Kino kicho kilamso notenda vinhu vose voyonilonda nie nitende.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">“Inukeni, tuchole.”<verse eid="JHN 14:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Iyo Mzabibu wa Ikweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1"/>Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, “Nie iyo mzabibu wa ikweli, na Tataangu iyo imulimi. <verse eid="JHN 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2"/>Kila tambi dili mgati yangu dilekile kulela, kodikanha. Na kila tambi dilela, kodifagilila giladi ding'ale na kulela ng'hani. <verse eid="JHN 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3"/>Mweye mwisha kung'alizwa na mafundo ganiwafundize. <verse eid="JHN 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4"/>Kaleni mgati yangu, na nie nokala mgati yenu. Kamba vija tambi vidileka kulela dihakala diiyeka, kamba hadikalile mumzabibu, vivija na mweye hamdaha kulela kamba hamkalile mgati yangu.<verse eid="JHN 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5"/>“Nie iyo mzabibu, na mweye mwa matambi. Awo wokala mgati yangu, na nie nihakala mgati yao, wolela ng'hani. Kwavija mweye hamdaha kutenda mbuli yoyose kamba hamkalile mgati yangu nie. <verse eid="JHN 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6"/>Munhu yoyose yoleka kukala mgati yangu kokwasigwa hanze kamba tambi na kuholola. Matambi kamba gano gokunzanywa na kwasigwa hamoto na kusomigwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7"/>Kamba muhakala mgati yangu na mbuli zangu zihakala mgati yenu, puleni kinhu chochose kimulonda, mogweleligwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8"/>Tataangu koyenzigwa mmbuli ino, avija mweye muhalela mujo bwando, na mowa wanahina zangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9"/>Nie niwanogela mweye kamba Tata viyaninogele nie. Kaleni mdinoge jangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10"/>Kamba muhazigoga ndagizi zangu, mokala mdinoge jangu, kamba nie vinizigogile ndagizi za Tataangu na kukala mdinoge jake.<verse eid="JHN 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11"/>“Niwalongela mweye gano giladi deng'ho jangu dikale mgati yenu na deng'ho jenu divikizwe. <verse eid="JHN 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12"/>Ndagizi yangu iyo ino, ‘Muinogele kamba nie viniwanogele mweye.’ <verse eid="JHN 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13"/>Haduhu munhu yali na noge kulu kubanza dino, da munhu kuulava ugima wake sama ya wambwiga zake. <verse eid="JHN 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14"/>Na mweye mowa wambwiga zangu muhatenda gaja ganiwalagiza. <verse eid="JHN 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15"/>Siwakema mweye watumigwa, kwavija watumigwa hawagatanga gaja goyotenda mkulu wao. Ila nowakema mweye wambwiga, kwavija niwalongela vinhu vose vinivihulike kulawa ha Tata. <verse eid="JHN 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16"/>Mweye hamunisagule nie, ila nie iyo niwasagule mweye na kuwalagiza mchole mkalele mujo bwando, mujo uja wondaukale milongo yose. Avo Tata kowagwelela chochose chondampule mtwaga jangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17"/>Avo nowalagiza vino, ‘Muinogele.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwihilwa na Wanhu wa Ulumwengu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18"/>Yesu kalonga, “Kamba ulumwengu uhawehila, m'vimanye kamba usonga kunihila nie tanhu. <verse eid="JHN 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19"/>Kamba mweye muhawile wa ulumwengu uno, ulumwengu uhawanogele kamba wanhu zake. Ila niwasagula mweye kulawa muulumwengu, na mweye vumuli si wa ulumwengu uno, kino kicho kilamso ulumwengu uwehila. <verse eid="JHN 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20"/>Kumbukileni gaja ganiwalongele, ‘Nyakadala hali mkulu kum'banza mtawala wake.’ Kamba wanhu wahanigaza nie, vivija wowagaza na mweye. Kamba wahagagoga mafundo gangu, vivija wogagoga mafundo genu. <verse eid="JHN 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21"/>Ila wowatendela gano gose sama ya twaga jangu, kwavija hawamtanga ayo yanhumile nie. <verse eid="JHN 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22"/>Maza sizile kulonga nao, sambiwawe na vilozo. Ila sambisambi wabule cha kuiyalalila m'vilozo vao. <verse eid="JHN 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23"/>Munhu yoyose yonihila nie vivija komwihila na Tataangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24"/>Maza sitendile sang'hano zija hazinatendigwa na munhu yoyose mmwao, sambiwawe na vilozo. Ila sambisambi wazona na tose watwihila, nie na Tataangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25"/>Gano galawilila giladi gavikizwe gaja gandikigwe Mmalagizo gao, golonga, ‘Wanihila bila kilamso.’<verse eid="JHN 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26"/>“Vondayeze Ija wa Kuwataza, ayo yondaniwagalile kulawa ha Tata, Loho wa ikweli yolawa ha Tata, kozilonga mbuli zangu nie. <verse eid="JHN 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27"/>Na mweye vivija molondigwa mzilonge mbuli zangu, kwavija mkala na nie songela haichanduso.<verse eid="JHN 15:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1"/>“Niwalongela mweye gano giladi sambimwage. <verse eid="JHN 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2"/>Mowingigwa kulawa mzing'anda za nhambiko, na kipigiti chokwiza munhu yahawakoma mweye kogelegeza kamba kotenda gamnogele Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3"/>Wowatendela mweye mbuli zino kwavija hawamtangile Tata ama nie. <verse eid="JHN 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4"/>Ila niwalongela gano mweye, giladi kipigiti hicho kihavika cha hewo kuzitenda mbuli zino mokumbukila kamba nisha kuwalongela.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 16:4">Sang'hano ya Loho wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">“Siwalongele mbuli zino haichanduso, kwavija nikala namwe. <verse eid="JHN 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5"/>Ila sambisambi nochola ha heyo yanhumile, hata avo haduhu munhu yoyose mmwanza wenu yambuzile, ‘Kwahi kuuchola?’ <verse eid="JHN 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6"/>Ila kwavija niwalongela mbuli zino, mioyo yenu ina giogio. <verse eid="JHN 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7"/>Ila nowalongela ikweli, vinoga ng'hani kumwenu vija vinichola, kwavija kamba sicholile, Ija wa Kuwataza heza kumwenu. Ila kamba nihachola, nomgala kumwenu. <verse eid="JHN 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8"/>Na yeheza, koulagusila ulumwengu kamba uhonyela mmbuli ya vilozo, uhonyela mgaja goyolonda Mulungu, na uhonyela mnhaguso ya Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9"/>Uhonyela mkutenda vilozo, kwavija uleka kunitogola nie, <verse eid="JHN 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10"/>uhonyela mkuleka kugagoga gaja goyolonda Mulungu, kwavija nochola ha Tata, ako kondamuleke kunyona kabili, <verse eid="JHN 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11"/>na uhonyela mnhaguso,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hano </char><char style="fk" closed="false">uhonyela mnhaguso </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">wanhu viwamkomile Yesu wagiza nhaguso isegela, ila wahonyela kwavija nhaguso ing'hali baho mana mtawala wa ulumwengu katagusigwa kamala.</char></note> kwavija mtawala wa ulumwengu uno kataguswa kamala.<verse eid="JHN 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12"/>“Nna mbuli bwando za kuwalongela, ila mkipigiti kino hamdaha kugagoga gose. <verse eid="JHN 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13"/>Ila ayo Loho wa ikweli yeheza, kowalongoza muikweli yose. Kwavija halonga gaja goyolonda heyo mwenyego, ila kolonga gaja gose goyohulika, na kowalongela mbuli zose zikwiza. <verse eid="JHN 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14"/>Koniyenzi nie, kwavija kozisola mbuli zangu na kuwapetela mweye. <verse eid="JHN 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15"/>Gose gayalinago Tataangu, gangu nie, kino kicho kilamso cha nie kulonga Loho kosola mbuli zangu nie na kuwapetela mweye.<verse eid="JHN 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Giogio Digaluka Ndeng'helelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16"/>“Kisigala kipigiti kidodo hamunyona, na kipigiti kidodo hamwande monyona.”<verse eid="JHN 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17"/>Wanahina zake wayagwe wakiiuza, “Mbuli ino nhegulo yake choni, ahaja hayatulongele, ‘Kisigala kipigiti kidodo hamunyona, na kipigiti kidodo hamwande monyona,’ na ‘Kwavija nochola ha Tata’?” <verse eid="JHN 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18"/>Walonga, “Mbuli ino nhegulo yake choni ahaja hayalongile, ‘Kipigiti kidodo’? Hatukitanga choyolonga!”<verse eid="JHN 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19"/>Yesu kavitanga kamba walonda kumuuza mbuli ino, avo kawalongela, “Mokiiuza nhegulo ya mbuli zija avija vinilongile, ‘Mkipigiti kidodo hamunyona, na abaho, mkipigiti kidodo monyona’? <verse eid="JHN 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20"/>Nowalongela ikweli, molila na kugegemeza, ila ulumwengu wodeng'helela. Mweye mokona giogio, ila giogio jenu dogaluka ndeng'helelo. <verse eid="JHN 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21"/>Mtwanzi yahawa mumgayo wa kulela kokona usungu, kwavija kipigiti chake kivika. Ila mwana yahavumbuka, koisemwa mgayo wake sama ya deng'ho da kuvumbuka mwana muulumwengu. <verse eid="JHN 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22"/>Vino vivo ili kumwenu, sambisambi muna giogio, ila nobwela kabili kumwenu na mioyo yenu yomema ndeng'helelo, haduhu munhu yondayaisegeze.<verse eid="JHN 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23"/>“Zua dija dihavika, hamuniuza kinhu chochose. Nowalongela ikweli, Tata kowagwelela chochose chondamumpule mtwaga jangu. <verse eid="JHN 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24"/>Mbaka sambisambi hamunapula kinhu chochose mtwaga jangu, puleni na mobokela giladi ndeng'helelo yenu ivikizwe.<verse eid="JHN 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nie Niuhuma Ulumwengu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25"/>“Niwalongela mbuli zino mmahala. Ila kipigiti chokwiza siwalongela mmahala, ila nomulonga Tata hakimwagaia. <verse eid="JHN 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26"/>Kuna dizua dija, mompula Tata mtwaga jangu. Silonga kamba nie nompula Tata sama yenu. <verse eid="JHN 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27"/>Tata mwenyego kowanogela mweye, kwavija mweye muninogela nie na mtogola kamba nilawa ha Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28"/>Nie nilawa ha Tata, niza muulumwengu. Na sambisambi nouleka ulumwengu, nobweleganya ha Tata.”<verse eid="JHN 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29"/>Abaho, wanahina zake wamulongela, “Sambisambi kolonga utobola, bila kwika mahala. <verse eid="JHN 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30"/>Sambisambi tuvitanga kamba kila kinhu kukitanga, na hulonda munhu yoyose yakuuze mbuli. Gano gatutenda tweye tutogole kamba kulawa ha Mulungu.”<verse eid="JHN 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Sambisambi mtogola? <verse eid="JHN 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32"/>Kipigiti chokwiza na kipigiti kivika, mweye mose vondampwililike, kila munhu na kumwake, na monileka nie niiyeka. Ila sikala niiyeka, kwavija Tata ka hamoja na nie. <verse eid="JHN 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33"/>Niwalongela gano giladi muwe na tindiwalo mkukala mgati yangu. Ulumwengu wowagaza, ila funyeni umoyo! Nie niuhuma ulumwengu!”<verse eid="JHN 16:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kowatambikila Wanahina Zake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1"/>Yesu viyamambukize kulonga gano, kalola uchana kuulanga, kalonga, “Tata, kipigiti kivika. Umuyenzi Mwanago, giladi Mwana yakuyenzi gweye. <verse eid="JHN 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2"/>Kwavija kumgwelela udaho mwa wanhu wose, awo yondayawagwelele ugima wa digunge, wanhu awo yuumgwelele. <verse eid="JHN 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3"/>Na ugima wa digunge uwo uno, wakutange gweye Mulungu wiyeka uli wa ikweli, na wamtange Yesu Kilisto yuumtumile. <verse eid="JHN 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4"/>Nikugalila yenzi muulumwengu mkuimambukiza sang'hano yuungwelele niitende. <verse eid="JHN 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5"/>Avo, Tata, uniyenzi haulongozi wako na yenzi kamba iija inikalile nayo kipigiti vinikalile nagwe kipigiti ulumwengu haunalumbigwa.<verse eid="JHN 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6"/>“Nikutenda gweye twaga jako ditangigwe na awo yuungwelele kulawa muulumwengu. Wakala wanhu zako, kungwelela nie, na waigoga mbuli yako. <verse eid="JHN 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7"/>Sambisambi wavitanga kamba vinhu vose vuungwelele vilawa kumwako. <verse eid="JHN 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8"/>Niwagwelela mbuli zuungwelele nie, na wazibokela. Wavitanga kamba nie nilawa kumwako, na watogola kamba gweye iyo unhumile.<verse eid="JHN 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9"/>“Nowatambikila. Siutambikila ulumwengu, ila awo yuungwelele, kwavija wano wanhu zako. <verse eid="JHN 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10"/>Wose inilinao nie, wako gweye, na wose uulinao gweye, wangu nie. Na nie mhata yenzi kubitila hewo. <verse eid="JHN 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11"/>Na sambisambi sili muulumwengu tena, ila hewo wa muulumwengu. Nie nokwiza kumwako. Tata Ung'alile! Wemilize na twaga jako, twaga diungwelele nie, giladi wawe kinhu kimwe kamba nie na gweye vituli kinhu kimwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12"/>Kipigiti vinikalile na hewo, niwemiliza na mhiko za twaga jako, twaga diungwelele nie. Niwakikiwiza, na haduhu hata imwe yapotele, ila ija imwe yalumbiligwe kupotela, giladi Nyandiko Zing'alile zivikile. <verse eid="JHN 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13"/>Na sambisambi nokwiza kumwako, ila nozilonga mbuli zino kipigiti ning'hali muulumwengu, giladi ndeng'helelo yangu imeme mgati yao. <verse eid="JHN 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14"/>Niwagwelela mbuli yako, na ulumwengu uwehila, kwavija hewo sio wa ulumwengu, kamba vija nie vinili sio wa ulumwengu. <verse eid="JHN 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15"/>Sikupula gweye uwalave muulumwengu, ila kinilonda kumwako uwemilize kulawa ha Mwenembago. <verse eid="JHN 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16"/>Hewo sio wa ulumwengu, kamba vija nie vinili sio wa ulumwengu. <verse eid="JHN 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17"/>Wang'alize na kweli yako. Mbuli yako iyo kweli. <verse eid="JHN 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18"/>Kamba gweye vuunhumile nie muulumwengu, na nie niwatuma hewo muulumwengu. <verse eid="JHN 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19"/>Noing'aliza sama yao, giladi na hewo vivija wang'alizwe kwelikweli.<verse eid="JHN 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20"/>“Siwatambikila wano weiyeka, ila vivija awo wondawanitogole kubitila usenga kulawa mwa wano. <verse eid="JHN 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21"/>Nowatambikila giladi wose wawe kinhu kimwe. Tata! Kamba gweye vuuli mgati yangu nie na nie vinili mgati yako gweye, na hewo vivija wawe mgati yetu tweye, giladi ulumwengu utogole kamba gweye iyo unhumile. <verse eid="JHN 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22"/>Niwagwelela yenzi kamba iija yuungwelele nie, giladi wawe kinhu kimwe kamba vija gweye na nie vituli kinhu kimwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23"/>Nie na mgati yao na gweye kwa mgati yangu, giladi wawe kinhu kimwe kabisa, na ulumwengu uvitange kamba gweye iyo unhumile, na kuwanogela kamba vuuninogele nie.<verse eid="JHN 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24"/>“Tata! Nolonda wano yuungwelele wakale hamoja na nie haja hondanikale, giladi wayone yenzi yangu yuungwelele, kwavija gweye kuninogela nie songela ulumwengu haunalumbigwa. <verse eid="JHN 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25"/>Tata Ulibule Uzenzeleganye! Ulumwengu haukutanga, ila nie nikutanga, na wano wakutanga kamba gweye iyo unhumile. <verse eid="JHN 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26"/>Nie iyo niditendile waditange twaga jako, na nogendelela kutenda avo, giladi vija vuuninogele nie uwanogele na hewo, avo na nie vivija niwe mgati yao.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kohonzigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat. 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mlk. 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk. 22:47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1"/>Yesu viyeshile kulonga mbuli zino, kasegela heyo na wanahina zake na kuloka bonde dikemigwa Kiduloni. Haja hakala na hanhu ha kuhumulila, avo Yesu na wanahina zake wengila haja. <verse eid="JHN 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2"/>Yuda, ija yomuhonza Yesu, kahatanga hanhu haja kwavija mianza bwando Yesu kakala yoiting'hanila na wanahina zake haja. <verse eid="JHN 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3"/>Avo Yuda kachola hanhu haja ha kuhumulila hamoja na asikali wa Kiloma na wemilizi wa Ing'anda ya Mulungu, watumigwe na wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko na Mafalisayo. Wakala na mizele kuno wagogile taa na miwenge. <verse eid="JHN 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4"/>Yesu kuno yovitanga vinhu vose vikalile vilonda kumulawilila heyo, kakwenhuka haulongozi kawauza, “Yalihi imumzahila?”<verse eid="JHN 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5"/>Wamwidika, “Yesu wa Nazaleti.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Kalonga, “Nie iyo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Yuda, ija yomuhonza Yesu, kakala bahaja yemile nao. <verse eid="JHN 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6"/>Yesu viyawalongele, “Nie iyo,” wabwela kuchugu, wagwa hasi. <verse eid="JHN 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7"/>Abaho, Yesu kawauza kabili, “Yalihi imumzahila?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">Wamulongela, “Yesu wa Nazaleti.”<verse eid="JHN 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Nisha kuwalongela, ‘Nie iyo.’ Kamba mweye monizahila nie, walekeni wano wayagwe wachole na zao.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9"/>Kalonga vino giladi gaja gayalongile gavikile, “Tata, waja ungwelele haduhu hata imwe inimwagize.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa muisula ya </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 6:39">6:39</ref></char> na muisula ya <char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 17:12">17:12</ref></char>. </note><verse eid="JHN 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10"/>Simoni Petulo, yakalile na zele, kadisomola na kumkanha gwiti da ukulume Maliko, nyakadala wa Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko. <verse eid="JHN 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11"/>Yesu kamulongela Petulo, “Bweza zele jako haja hadikalile! Kokwagiza nie sing'wela kikasi cha mgayo chayangwelele Tataangu?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Haulongozi wa Anasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12"/>Abaho, asikali wa Waloma na mkulu wao na wemilizi wa Ng'anda ya Mulungu wamgoga Yesu wamfunga, <verse eid="JHN 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13"/>tanhu wamgala ha Anasi, yakalile tata mkwe yake Kayafa, yakalile Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko mulao uja. <verse eid="JHN 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14"/>Kayafa iyo yakalile yawalongele wakulu wa Wayahudi kamba vinoga munhu imwe yadanganhike sama ya wanhu wose.<verse eid="JHN 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petulo Kom'bela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Mat. 26:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Mlk. 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luk. 22:55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15"/>Simoni Petulo na mwanahina iyagwe wamkweleleza Yesu. Kwavija ija imwanahina iyagwe kakala yatangigwe goya na Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko, avo kengila na Yesu mulubuga lwa mgati ya idikonhi da ing'anda ya Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko, <verse eid="JHN 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16"/>na Petulo kasigala hanze behi na ulwivi lwa idikonhi. Abaho, ija imwanahina iyagwe, yakalile yatangigwe goya na Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko, kabweleganya hanze kulonga na mndele yakalile mwimilizi wa ulwivi, na kumwingiza Petulo mgati ya idikonhi. <verse eid="JHN 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17"/>Ija imndele yokwimiliza ulwivi kamulongela Petulo, “Na gweye vivija kwa mwanahina wa munhu ija?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">Petulo kamwidika, “Nie sili mwanahina wake.”<verse eid="JHN 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18"/>Kwavija kukala na beho waja iwanyakadala na iwemilizi wabwinha moto wa misizi, wakala wokota. Petulo na heyo vivija kakala yemile na hewo, yokota.<verse eid="JHN 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mkulu wa Wakulu Wose wa Nhambiko Komuuzagiza Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat. 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mlk. 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luk. 22:66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19"/>Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko kamuuza Yesu mbuli ya wanahina zake na mafundo gake. <verse eid="JHN 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Mazua gose nikala nilonga na wanhu wose hakimwagaia, mafundo gangu gose nifundiza mzing'anda za nhambiko na Kung'anda ya Mulungu amuja Wayahudi wose mowaiting'hana. Silongile kinhu chochose mkuifisa. <verse eid="JHN 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21"/>Avo habali uniuzagiza nie? Wauze awo wakalile wonhegeleza, wagatanga ganilongile.”<verse eid="JHN 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22"/>Yesu viyalongile gano, mwimilizi imwe yakalile haja kamtoa kofi na kumulongela, “Kodahaze kumulongela kamba avo Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko!”<verse eid="JHN 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23"/>Yesu kamwidika, yolonga, “Kamba nilonga kinhu chochose kihile, kilonge kinhu hicho. Ila kamba silongile kinhu kihile mmbuli zinilongile, habali unhoa?”<verse eid="JHN 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24"/>Abaho, Anasi kamgala ha Kayafa Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko, kuno Yesu yang'hali yadazigwe nzabi.<verse eid="JHN 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petulo Kom'bela Yesu Kabili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Mat. 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Mlk. 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luk. 22:58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25"/>Kipigiti Petulo yang'hali yemile haja yokota moto, wanhu wayagwe wamulongela, “Gweye huli imwe wa wanahina zake munhu ija?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">Petulo kabela, kalonga, “Nie sio.”<verse eid="JHN 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26"/>Nyakadala imwe wa Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko, ndugu yake munhu ija yakanhigwe gwiti jake na Petulo, kamuuza, “Nie sikonile gweye na heyo haja hanhu ha kuhumulila?”<verse eid="JHN 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27"/>Kabili Petulo kabela, yolonga, “Sio nie.” Na bahaja nzogolo keka.<verse eid="JHN 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kogaligwa ha Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat. 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mlk. 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk. 23:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28"/>Imitondo ng'hani Yesu kasoligwa kulawa kung'anda ya Kayafa wamgala kuding'anda da kindewa da Pilato, mndewa wa Yudea kulawa Loma. Wakulu wa Wayahudi hawengile mding'anda da kindewa, kwavija wadumba kuinyolodosa, kamba viili nzoela yao, giladi waije Pasaka. <verse eid="JHN 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29"/>Avo Pilato, mkulu wa isi ya Loma, kalawa hanze, kawauza, “Choni chumumtagusila munhu ino?”<verse eid="JHN 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30"/>Wamwidika, “Kamba yahakalile bule mbuli ihile, sambitumgale kumwako.”<verse eid="JHN 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31"/>Pilato kawalongela, “Msoleni mwemwe wenyego, mkamtaguse kamba malagizo genu vigalonga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Wamulongela, “Tweye hatulongeligwe kumtagusa munhu yoyose kudanganhika.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32"/>Gano galawilila giladi kuzitenda mbuli za Yesu zilawilile, haja hayailongile ifa yondayafe.<verse eid="JHN 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33"/>Pilato kabweleganya mding'anda da kindewa na kumkema Yesu, kamuuza, “Gweye iyo Mndewa wa Wayahudi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Mbuli ino yuuniuza yolawa kumwako, ama wanhu wayagwe wakulongela mbuli zangu nie?”<verse eid="JHN 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35"/>Pilato kamwidika, “Kokwagiza nie na Muyahudi? Wanhu zako mwenyego na wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko wakugalile kumwangu. Kutenda choni?”<verse eid="JHN 18:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36"/>Yesu kalonga, “Undewa wangu si wa ulumwengu uno. Kamba undewa wangu uhawile wa ulumwengu uno, wemilizi zangu wahagombile kunigombeleza sambinigogigwe na wakulu wa Wayahudi. Ila undewa wangu sio wa hano!”<verse eid="JHN 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37"/>Avo Pilato kamuuza, “Avo, gweye kwa mndewa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">Yesu kamwidika, “Gweye iyo ulonga kamba nie iyo mndewa. Nivumbuka sama ya mbuli ino, na sama ya mbuli ino niza muulumwengu kuilonga ikweli. Munhu yoyose yali muikweli konhegeleza.”<verse eid="JHN 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38"/>Pilato kamuuza, “Ikweli iyo ilihi?”</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 18:38">Yesu Kotaguswa Kudanganhika</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Mat. 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Mlk. 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk. 23:13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Abaho, Pilato kabweleganya hanze ha Wayahudi, na kuwalongela, “Nie sonile mbuli yoyose ya kumtagusila. <verse eid="JHN 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39"/>Ila kwavija muna nzoela ya nie kuwafungulila mfungigwa imwe kipigiti cha Pasaka, avo molonda niwafungulile Mndewa wa Wayahudi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40"/>Wamwidika mkuguta nyangi, “Sambiutufungulile heyo! Tufungulile Balaba!” Balaba kakala m'bokonyi.<verse eid="JHN 18:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1"/>Abaho, Pilato kalagiza Yesu yagogigwe na kulanhigwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2"/>Asikali watenda mkungo wa mizomola na kumwikila mditwi jake. Abaho wam'vaza kanzu da zambalau, <verse eid="JHN 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3"/>na wamwizila mianza bwando womtendela mzihaka, wolonga, “Kwa mpile, Mndewa wa Wayahudi!” na kumtoa makofi mkihanga.<verse eid="JHN 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4"/>Pilato kalawa hanze mwanza uyagwe, na kuwalongela waja iwanhu, “Loleni, nowalavileni hanze munhu ino m'vitange kamba sonile mbuli yoyose ya kumtagusila.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5"/>Avo Yesu kalawa hanze yavalile kanzu da zambalau na mkungo wa mizomola mditwi. Pilato kawalongela, “Loleni, munhu mwenyego ino hano!”<verse eid="JHN 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6"/>Wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko na iwemilizi wa Ing'anda ya Mulungu viwamonile, waguta, wolonga, “Muwambe mumsalaba! Muwambe mumsalaba!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Pilato kawalongela, “Nie sonile mbuli ya kumtagusila, avo msoleni mwemwe mkamuwambe mumsalaba.”<verse eid="JHN 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7"/>Wayahudi wamulongela, “Tweye tuna lagizo, na sama ya lagizo hijo kolondigwa yadanganhike, kwavija kailonga heyo ka Mwana wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8"/>Pilato viyahulike gano, kagendelela kona bwembwe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pilato kadumba kwavija mngelegeza zake kagiza kamba Yesu ka mmwanza wa miungu igaluke kuwa wanhu, avo yahatendigwa gehile kogaluka na kumkoma heyo.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9"/>Kabweleganya mgati ya iding'anda da kindewa na kumuuza Yesu, “Kwahi kuulawa gweye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:9">Ila Yesu hamwidike. <verse eid="JHN 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10"/>Pilato kamulongela, “Hunilongela? Huvitanga kamba nie nna udaho wa kukufungula na vivija nna udaho wa kukuwamba mumsalaba?”<verse eid="JHN 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Gweye sambiuwe na udaho kumwangu nie kamba sambiugweleligwe na Mulungu. Avo munhu yangelile nie mmakono gako kana vilozo vikulu ng'hani.”<verse eid="JHN 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12"/>Songela kipigiti kija, Pilato kageza kumfungula Yesu, ila Wayahudi wagendelela kutoa nyangi, wolonga, “Kamba uhamfungula munhu ino, gweye huli mbwiga wa Kaisali.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:12 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Kaisali </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mndewa wa Loma.</char></note> Munhu yoyose yokiikema mndewa kom'beza Kaisali!”<verse eid="JHN 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13"/>Pilato viyahulike mbuli zino, kamulava Yesu kunze, abaho, heyo kakala mkigoda cha nhaguso, hanhu hokemigwa, “Bugano da Mabwe,” ama Mkieblania wohakema, “Gabbata.” <verse eid="JHN 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14"/>Dikala zua da msasalo wa wiki ya Pasaka, kamba saa sita imisi. Pilato kawalongela Wayahudi, “Mndewa wenu ino hano!”<verse eid="JHN 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15"/>Wenula lwangi, womulongela, “Mkome! Mkome! Muwambe mumsalaba!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Pilato kawauza, “Molonda nie nimuwambe mumsalaba mndewa wenu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko wamwidika, “Tweye twabule mndewa iyagwe ila Kaisali.”<verse eid="JHN 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16"/>Abaho, Pilato kamgela Yesu mmakono gao wakamuwambe mumsalaba.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 19:16">Yesu Kowambigwa Mumsalaba</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat. 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mlk. 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk. 23:26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Avo wamsola Yesu, <verse eid="JHN 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17"/>kuno yapapile msalaba wake heyo mwenyego, kachola “Hanhu ha Fulu da Pala” aho hakemigwe Mkieblania, “Goligota.” <verse eid="JHN 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18"/>Haja baho wamuwambile, na vivija wawawamba wanhu wayagwe wabili, imwe mkono wake wa ukumoso na imwe mkono wake wa ukulume, na Yesu hagatigati yao. <verse eid="JHN 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19"/>Pilato kalagiza chandikwe kibao kikigwe uchana ya umsalaba, kilonga, <char style="sc">“yesu wa nazaleti, mndewa wa wayahudi.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20"/>Wayahudi bwando wakisoma, kwavija hanhu hayawambigwe Yesu hakala si kutali kulawa hakiwambo. Kija ikibao kikala chandikigwe Mkieblania, Mkilatini, na Mkigiliki. <verse eid="JHN 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21"/>Wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko wa Wayahudi wamulongela Pilato, “Sambiwandike ‘Mndewa wa Wayahudi,’ ila uhandike, ‘Munhu ino kalonga, nie iyo Mndewa wa Wayahudi.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22"/>Pilato kawedika, yolonga, “Kinyandike, nyandika.”<verse eid="JHN 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23"/>Asikali viweshile kumuwamba Yesu mumsalaba, wasola vivalo vake na kuvigola m'vifumvugulu vine, kila imwe na kifumvugulu chake. Vivija wasola ikanzu ilukigwe dimwe kwa dimwe bila lusilili lwa kushonigwa koneka. <verse eid="JHN 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24"/>Waja iwaasikali wakiilongela, “Sambituidege, na tuitoele kula tulole yalihi yondayaipate.” Galawilila gano giladi kuzitenda Zinyandiko Zing'alile zivikile, zilonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">“Waigolela vivalo vangu wenyego kwa wenyego</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">na kuitoela kula kanzu yangu.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Vino vivo iwaasikali viwatendile.<verse eid="JHN 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25"/>Behi na umsalaba wa Yesu wakala wemile mamaake Yesu, na lumbu ja mamaake Yesu, na Maliamu mtwanzi wa Kiliopa, na Maliamu wa kiwambo cha Magidala. <verse eid="JHN 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26"/>Yesu viyamonile mamaake na ija imwanahina yamnogele yemile hamgwazo wake, kamulongela mamaake, “Mama, ino iyo mwanago.”<verse eid="JHN 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27"/>Abaho, kamulongela ija imwanahina, “Ino iyo mamaako.” Songela kipigiti kija, ija imwanahina kamsola kachola kukala nayo ukae yake.<verse eid="JHN 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kodanganhika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat. 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mlk. 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk. 23:44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28"/>Yesu kavitanga kamba kipigiti kino kila kinhu kimala, na giladi yazitende Zinyandiko Zing'alile zilawilile kweli, kalonga, “Nokona ng'hilu.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">ZABULI 69:21</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="JHN 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29"/>Na haja kukala na kikonha kimemile divai ya ugwadu, avo wazabika siponji mkikonha cha idivai, waika isiponji mulumango lwa hisopo, wawinula mbaka hamulomo wake. <verse eid="JHN 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30"/>Yesu kaing'wa idivai na kulonga, “Imala!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:30">Abaho, kaidulika na kudanganhika.<verse eid="JHN 19:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kotoboligwa Ulubavu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31"/>Avija vidikalile zua da msasalo wa Pasaka, na zua da ikabili dikala Zua kulu da Mhumulo, wakulu wa Wayahudi hawalondile waja iwanhu walekigwe mmisalaba kipigiti cha Zua da Mhumulo. Avo wampula Pilato yalagize gabenigwe magulu ga wanhu wawambigwe mumsalaba. Abaho wawahumuluse hasi. <verse eid="JHN 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32"/>Avo asikali weza na kubena magulu ga munhu wa ichanduso, yakalile yawambigwe mumsalaba hamoja na Yesu, abaho ija wa ikabili. <verse eid="JHN 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33"/>Ila viwavikile ha Yesu, wam'vika yeshile kudanganhika, avo magulu gake hawagabenile. <verse eid="JHN 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34"/>Ila asikali imwe kamuhoma Yesu mulubavu na mgoha wake, na bahaja ulawa mulopa na mazi. <verse eid="JHN 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35"/>Munhu yonile gano galawilile kagalonga, giladi na mweye vivija mtogole. Na gaja gayalongile kalonga kweli, na heyo kavimanya kamba kalonga kweli. <verse eid="JHN 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36"/>Mbuli zino zilawilila giladi Zinyandiko Zing'alile zivikile, “Haduhu hata luzege lwake lumwe londalubenigwe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 12:46">KUHALAWA 12:46</ref></char>, <char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 9:12">MHETA 9:12</ref></char>, <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 34:20">ZABULI 34:20</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="JHN 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37"/>Na kuna Nyandiko ziyagwe Zing'alile zilonga, “Womulola ayo iwamtobole.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 12:10">ZAKALIA 12:10</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="JHN 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mazisi ga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat. 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mlk. 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk. 23:50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38"/>Abaho, Usufu, yakalile yolawa kukiwambo cha Alimataya, kampula Pilato yalusole lukuli lwa Yesu. Usufu kakala mwanahina wa Yesu, ila kakala yoifisa, kwavija kakala yowadumba wakulu wa Wayahudi. Pilato kamulongela yakalusole, avo Usufu kachola kulusegeza. <verse eid="JHN 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39"/>Nikodemo, ayo haichanduso yakalile yacholile ikilo kumulola Yesu, kachola na Usufu na kibweta cha vinung'hanung'ha va manemane na ubane vikalile na nzamo ya kilo malongo madatu. <verse eid="JHN 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40"/>Wanhu wano wabili walusola lukuli lwa Yesu, na kulugela msanda na ivinung'hanung'ha, kamba viwatendaga Wayahudi mkusasala lukuli na mazisi. <verse eid="JHN 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41"/>Haja Yesu hayakomigwe kukala na hanhu ha kuhumulila, hanhu haja hakala na panga da sambi hadinazikigwa munhu yoyose. <verse eid="JHN 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42"/>Kwavija dikala zua da Wayahudi da msasalo wa Zua da Mhumulo, na kwavija dija idipanga dikala behi, walwika lukuli lwa Yesu haja.<verse eid="JHN 19:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kozuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat. 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mlk. 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk. 24:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1"/>Ndamuka ya zua da mwanduso wa wiki,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:1 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Zua da mwanduso wa wiki </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">jumapili.</char></note> usiku haunakucha goya, Maliamu wa kiwambo cha Magidala kachola kudipanga, kavika idibwe dikalile hamulomo wa idipanga disegezigwa. <verse eid="JHN 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2"/>Kakimbila kachola ha Simoni Petulo na ha ija imwanahina iyagwe ayo Yesu yamnogele na kuwalongela, “Wamsegeza Mndewa haja hadipanga, na hatukutangile kuwamwikile!”<verse eid="JHN 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3"/>Abaho, Petulo na ija imwanahina iyagwe wachola kudipanga. <verse eid="JHN 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4"/>Wose wabili wakimbila, ila ija imwanahina iyagwe kakimbila ng'hani kum'banza Petulo na kumulongola kuvika kudipanga. <verse eid="JHN 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5"/>Kainamila na kusungulila mgati, kayona isanda, ila hengile mgati. <verse eid="JHN 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6"/>Simoni Petulo yakalile kuchugu chake, kavika na kengila dimwe kwa dimwe mdipanga. Kavona ivitambala va isanda viwasile haja, <verse eid="JHN 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7"/>vivija na ikitambala kikalile kizingilizwe mdipala da Yesu. Hakikalile hamoja na isanda ila kikunzigwa na kiinega kutali na isanda. <verse eid="JHN 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8"/>Abaho, ija imwanahina iyagwe yavikile haichanduso kudipanga na heyo kengila mgati, kalola na kutogola. <verse eid="JHN 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9"/>Wakala hawanazimanya Zinyandiko Zing'alile zilonga kamba kolondigwa yazuke kulawa mkudanganhika. <verse eid="JHN 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10"/>Abaho, waja iwanahina wabweleganya mkae zao.<verse eid="JHN 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Komulawilila Maliamu wa Kiwambo cha Magidala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat. 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Mlk. 16:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11"/>Maliamu kema hanze ya idipanga yolila. Kuno yang'hali yolila, kainamila kalola mgati mwa idipanga, <verse eid="JHN 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12"/>na kawona wasenga wabili wa Mulungu wa kuulanga wavalile miguo mizelu, wakala haja halukalile lukuli lwa Yesu, imwe kuna iditwi na imwe kuna gamagulu. <verse eid="JHN 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13"/>Wamuuza, “Gweye mtwanzi, habali ulila?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">Kedika, yolonga, “Wamsegeza Mndewa wangu, na sikutangile kuwamwikile!”<verse eid="JHN 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14"/>Abaho, kahinduka, kamona Yesu yemile bahaja, ila havimanyile kamba kakala Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15"/>Yesu kamuuza, “Gweye mtwanzi, habali ulila? Yalihi yuumzahila?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Kuno yokwagiza kakala msang'hanika wa haja ihanhu ha kuhumulila, avo kamulongela, “Mndewa, kamba gweye iyo umsegeze, nongela kwahi kuumwikile nichole nikamsole.”<verse eid="JHN 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Maliamu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">Kamuhindukila na kulonga Mkieblania, “Labboni!” Nhegulo yake, “Mkulufunzi.”<verse eid="JHN 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Sambiuninanahile kwavija sinachola uchana ha Tata. Ila genda ha wanahina zangu uwalongele kamba nie nobweleganya ha Tataangu na Tata wenu, Mulungu wangu na Mulungu wenu.”<verse eid="JHN 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18"/>Avo Maliamu wa kiwambo cha Magidala kachola kuwalongela wanahina kamba kamona Mndewa, na kuwalongela gaja gose gayamulongele.<verse eid="JHN 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kowalawilila Wanahina Zake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat. 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mlk. 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk. 24:36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19"/>Ikala ichungulo ya zua da mwanduso wa wiki,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:19 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Zua da mwanduso wa wiki </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">jumapili.</char></note> na wanahina wakala waiting'hane hamoja na kuno nyivi za ing'anda zikala zihindigwe, kwavija wakala wowadumba wakulu wa Wayahudi. Abaho, Yesu keza na kwima hamoja na hewo, kalonga, “Tindiwalo diwe hamoja namwe.” <verse eid="JHN 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20"/>Viyeshile kulonga gano, kawalagusila makono gake na lubavu lwake. Waja iwanahina wakala wamemile ndeng'helelo viwamonile Mndewa. <verse eid="JHN 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21"/>Yesu kawalongela kabili, “Tindiwalo diwe hamoja namwe. Kamba vija Tata viyanhumile nie, avo na nie nowatuma.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22"/>Abaho, kawahuzila na mhumuzi yake, kawalongela, “Bokeleni Loho wa Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23"/>Kamba muhavigela kumgongo vilozo va wanhu, vogeligwa kumgongo. Na kamba hamuvigelile kumgongo, havigeligwa kumgongo.”<verse eid="JHN 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Tomaso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24"/>Imwe wa waja wanahina longo dimwe na wabili yokemigwa Tomaso, twaga diyagwe Ubasa, kakala haduhu viyezile Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25"/>Avo waja iwanahina wayagwe wamulongela, “Tumona Mndewa!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">Tomaso kawalongela, “Kamba sonile ng'hovu za misumali mmakono gake na kwika kidole changu mzing'hovu zake na mkono wangu mulubavu lwake, sitogola kamba kazuka!”<verse eid="JHN 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26"/>Vigabitile mazua saba wanahina zake waiting'hana kabili mng'anda, na Tomaso kakala baho. Nyivi zikala zihindigwe, ila Yesu keza na kwima na hewo, kalonga, “Tindiwalo diwe hamoja namwe.” <verse eid="JHN 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27"/>Abaho, kamulongela Tomaso, “Ika kidole chako na ugalole makono gangu, abaho, golosa mkono wako uwike mulubavu lwangu. Sambiudungwedungwe mmoyo, ila utogole.”<verse eid="JHN 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28"/>Tomaso kamulongela, “Mndewa wangu na Mulungu wangu.”<verse eid="JHN 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Gweye kutogola kamba nizuka kwavija kunyona. Wamota ng'hani awo wondawatogole bila kunyona.”<verse eid="JHN 20:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kilamso cha Kwandika Kitabu Kino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30"/>Mizonza yaatendile Yesu hameso ga wanahina zake ilekile kwandikigwa mkitabu kino ikala bwando. <verse eid="JHN 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31"/>Ila gano gandikigwa giladi mtogole kamba Yesu iyo Kilisto, Mwana wa Mulungu, na mkutogola gano muupate ugima mtwaga jake.<verse eid="JHN 20:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kowalawilila Wanahina Saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1"/>Abaho, Yesu kawalawilila wanahina zake mwanza uyagwe Kudilamba da Tibelia. Vino vivo viyawalawilile. <verse eid="JHN 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2"/>Simoni Petulo, na Tomaso yakemigwe Ubasa, na Natanieli ayo yakalile yolawa Kana ako Galilaya, na wana wa Zebedayo, na wanahina wayagwe wabili wa Yesu wakala hamoja. <verse eid="JHN 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3"/>Simoni Petulo kawalongela wayage, “Nie nochola kuloa somba.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">Wamulongela, “Na tweye tokwiza.” Avo walawa wachola kwingila mngalawa, ila ikilo ija hawapatile kinhu. <verse eid="JHN 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4"/>Imitondo ng'hani, Yesu kema mulugigo lwa igamazi, ila wanahina zake hawamtangile kamba kakala heyo. <verse eid="JHN 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5"/>Kawauza, “wambwiga zangu, muna somba?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Walonga, “Twabule.”<verse eid="JHN 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6"/>Kawalongela, “Tandeni nhando yenu ng'ambu ya ukulume ya ingalawa, na mokonza.” Avo waitanda inhando na hawadahile kuikwega waibweze mngalawa, kwavija wawonza somba bwando.<verse eid="JHN 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7"/>Ija imwanahina Yesu iyamnogele kamulongela Petulo, “Kumbe Mndewa!” Petulo viyahulike kumbe Mndewa, kaizinga mkigudi kivalo chake cha kuigubika, na kuzumha mmazi, kwavija kakala yavulile vivalo vake. <verse eid="JHN 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8"/>Wanahina wayagwe weza kuingalawa na kuikwekwesa inhando imemile somba, kwavija hawakalile kutali kulawa muisi inyalile, ikala kamba meta mia. <verse eid="JHN 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9"/>Viwavikile muisi inyalile, wona moto wa misizi, uchana yake kukala somba na mkate. <verse eid="JHN 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10"/>Abaho, Yesu kawalongela, “Ngalileni somba kidogo wumonzile sambisambi.”<verse eid="JHN 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11"/>Simoni Petulo kachola mngalawa na kuibululila kunyalile inhando imemile somba wakulu mia imwe na malongo matano na wadatu. Wakala somba bwando hata avo inhando haidegeke. <verse eid="JHN 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Izoni mje.” Haduhu hata mwanahina imwe yagezile kumuuza, “Gweye iyo yalihi?” kwavija wavitanga kamba kakala Mndewa. <verse eid="JHN 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13"/>Avo Yesu kachola kasola umkate na kuwagwelela, abaho, katenda vivija na isomba.<verse eid="JHN 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14"/>Uno ukala mwanza wa ikadatu Yesu kuwalawilila wanahina zake songela hayazukile.<verse eid="JHN 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Petulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15"/>Viweshile kuja, Yesu kamulongela Simoni Petulo, “Simoni, mwana wa Yohana, koninogela nie kubanza wano wayagwe viwoninogela?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Kamwidika, “Ona, Mndewa, gweye kuvitanga kamba nokunogela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Yesu kamulongela, “Wagwelele mandia ng'hondolo zangu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16"/>Yesu kamulongela mwanza wa ikabili, “Simoni, mwana wa Yohana, koninogela nie?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Kamwidika, “Ona, Mndewa, gweye kuvitanga kamba nie nokunogela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Yesu kamulongela, “Imiliza ng'hondolo zangu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17"/>Yesu kalonga mwanza wa ikadatu, “Simoni, mwana wa Yohana, koninogela?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Petulo kona giogio avija Yesu viyamuuzile mwanza wa ikadatu, “Koninogela?” Avo kamulongela Yesu, “Mndewa, gweye kugamanya gose. Na kuvimanya kamba nokunogela!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Yesu kamulongela, “Wagwelele mandia ng'hondolo zangu. <verse eid="JHN 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18"/>Nokulongela ikweli, vuukalile mmhale, kukala ukiifunga mkwiji na kuchola kokose kuulondile kuchola. Ila uhalala, kogogolosa makono gako na munhu iyagwe kokufunga na kukusola yakugale hanhu hukulondile kuchola.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19"/>Mkulonga gano, Yesu kalagusa ifa ilihi Petulo yondayafe na yondaimgalile yenzi Mulungu. Abaho, kamulongela, “Nikweleleze.”<verse eid="JHN 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Wanahina Zake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20"/>Petulo kahinduka kuchugu kamona ija imwanahina Yesu iyamnogele kowakweleleza. Ino iyo munhu ija yakalile behi na Yesu viwakalile woja mkate wa ugima na iyo yalongile, “Mndewa, yalihi yondayakuhonze?” <verse eid="JHN 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21"/>Petulo viyamuwene, kamuuza Yesu, “Mndewa, vilihi na ino?”<verse eid="JHN 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Kamba nihalonda yakale mbaka niheza, ikudwanzaze? Nikweleleze!”<verse eid="JHN 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23"/>Avo mbuli zenela mwa wanahina wa Yesu kamba mwanahina ino hadanganhika. Ila Yesu halongile vija kamba hadanganhika, ila kalonga, “Kamba nihalonda yakale mbaka niheza, ikudwanzaze?”<verse eid="JHN 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24"/>Heyo iyo ija imwanahina yazilongile mbuli zino, na vivija iyo yazandike, na tuvimanya kamba gaja gayalongile kalonga kweli.<verse eid="JHN 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kimambukizilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25"/>Na kuna mbuli bwando ziyagwe zayatendile Yesu. Kamba zose zihandikwe, nokwagiza kamba ulumwengu wose sambiudahe kuvipapa ivitabu vandikigwe.<verse eid="JHN 21:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21"/>
</usx>
